window.ACP_Q=[{"id":"420.1.1-e01","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A developer occasionally helps the IT service desk investigate bugs. He has a Jira license but no Jira Service Management license, and he must only add internal notes on requests. How should he be set up?","zh":"一位開發人員偶爾協助 IT service desk 調查 bug。他有 Jira 授權但沒有 JSM 授權，而且只能在 request 上加內部備註。應該怎麼設定他？","zo":["給他 Administer Projects 權限","在每張 request 把他加成 request participant","把他加到 Service Desk Team role，成為 collaborator","把他加到 Service Desk Customers role"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant him the Administer Projects permission","Add him as a request participant on each request","Add him to the Service Desk Team role as a collaborator","Add him to the Service Desk Customers role"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects 是 project admin 的權限，遠超過「只留內部備註」的需求，違反最小權限；而且沒有 JSM 授權仍無法當 agent。","B":"錯。Request participant 是 customer 端被分享 request 的人，留言會被 customer 看到，不是內部討論的做法。","C":"對。有 Jira 授權、沒有 JSM 授權的人放進 Service Desk Team role 就是 collaborator：能看 request、加 internal comment、附件、記工時，正好符合「只留內部備註」。","D":"錯。Service Desk Customers role 用來辨識 customer，customer 走 portal、看不到 internal comment，也不能在 Jira 裡處理 request。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-users-and-roles-are-there-in-jira-service-management/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e02","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions can a collaborator perform in a company-managed service project? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 company-managed service project 中，collaborator 能做哪些事？（選兩個）","zo":["把 customer 加進 project","加 internal comment","以公開留言回覆 customer","在 work item 記錄工時","建立 queue"],"fig":"","opts":["Add customers to the project","Add internal comments","Reply to customers with public comments","Log work on work items","Create queues"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。新增 customer 是 agent 與 admin 的能力，collaborator 沒有。","B":"對。Collaborator 可以加 internal comment，並刪除自己的留言。","C":"錯。公開回覆 customer 是 agent 的能力；官方說給 collaborator 更多權限也不會被支援。","D":"對。官方列出 collaborator 可以 log、edit、delete 自己的 work log。","E":"錯。建立 queue 是 project admin 的工作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-users-and-roles-are-there-in-jira-service-management/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e03","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin is building a custom permission scheme for a service project. To which entity should customer permissions such as Create Work Items and Add Comments be granted?","zh":"Jira admin 正在替 service project 建自訂 permission scheme。Create Work Items、Add Comments 這類 customer 權限應該授權給誰？","zo":["Application access：Any logged in user","Service Desk Customer - Portal Access security type","Service Desk Customers project role","jira-servicemanagement-customers 這個 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Application access: Any logged in user","The Service Desk Customer - Portal Access security type","The Service Desk Customers project role","The group jira-servicemanagement-customers"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Any logged in user 會讓所有登入的 Jira 使用者都拿到權限，範圍遠超過 customer，也不是 customer 走 portal 的機制。","B":"對。官方要求 customer 的權限給 Service Desk Customer - Portal Access security type：讓 customer 進 portal、但不能進 Jira，並透過 Service Desk Customers role 判斷誰是 customer。","C":"錯。官方特別說明 customer 的權限不要直接給 Service Desk Customers role；這個 role 只是讓 security type 用來判斷誰是 customer。","D":"錯。直接授權給 group 會讓部分 service project 功能失效，官方要求用 role 與 Portal Access。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/customize-jira-service-management-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e04","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which users consume a Jira Service Management agent license? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些使用者會佔用 JSM 的 agent 授權？（選兩個）","zo":["Request participants","Customer organization 的成員","在 service project 處理 request 的 project administrator","透過 email 提單的 customer","Service Desk Team role 中被給予 JSM 產品存取的成員"],"fig":"","opts":["Request participants","Members of a customer organization","Project administrators who work on requests in the service project","Customers who raise requests through email","Members of the Service Desk Team role who were granted JSM product access"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Request participant 是被分享 request 的 customer，同樣免費。","B":"錯。Organization 只是 customer 的群組，成員都是免費 customer。","C":"對。Project admin 是 licensed user，在 service project 處理 request 要 JSM 授權。","D":"錯。Customer 免費，不佔任何授權。","E":"對。Service Desk Team role 裡有 JSM 產品存取的人就是 agent，佔 JSM 授權。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-users-and-roles-are-there-in-jira-service-management/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e05","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An agent shares a request with Priya by adding her to the Request participants field, but Priya cannot open the request in the help center. The other customers can view their own requests. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Agent 把 Priya 加到 Request participants 欄位分享 request，但 Priya 在 help center 打不開這張 request；其他 customer 都看得到自己的 request。最可能的原因？","zo":["Priya 需要 JSM agent 授權","Priya 不在 Service Desk Team role","這張 request 的 issue security level 沒有包含 Priya","Request participant 本來就看不到 request"],"fig":"","opts":["Priya needs a JSM agent license","Priya is not in the Service Desk Team role","The issue security level on the request does not include Priya","Request participants never receive access to requests"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。看自己被分享的 request 不需要 agent 授權，participant 是免費的。","B":"錯。Participant 是 customer 端身分，本來就不需要在 Service Desk Team role。","C":"對。官方：request participant 一樣受 issue security 限制；security level 只開給 reporter 時，participant 看不到。","D":"錯。Participant 被分享後可以看、留言、收通知；看不到是例外，不是設計。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-request-participants/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e06","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about customer organizations in Jira Service Management is correct?","zh":"關於 JSM 的 customer organization，哪一個敘述正確？","zo":["它只能用在一個 service project","它是可以跨多個 service project 重複使用的 customer 群組","每個 organization 成員都佔一個 agent 授權","它就是 Atlassian Administration 裡的 Atlassian organization"],"fig":"","opts":["They can only be used in one service project","They are groups of customers that can be reused across multiple service projects","Each organization member consumes an agent license","They are the same as the Atlassian organization managed in Atlassian Administration"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Organization 的用意就是跨 project 重複使用，不用每個 project 重加一次人。","B":"對。Organization 是 customer 的群組，可以加到多個 service project。","C":"錯。Organization 成員是 customer，免費。","D":"錯。官方特別提醒 customer organization 跟 Atlassian organization 不同；後者是集中管理使用者與產品存取的單位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-service-desk-customers-and-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e07","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who controls which users have Jira Service Management product access (and therefore can work as agents)?","zh":"誰控制哪些使用者擁有 JSM 產品存取（也就是能當 agent）？","zo":["Space lead","該 service project 的 project admin","Organization admin（或有使用者存取管理權限的 admin）","Service Desk Team role 裡的任何 agent"],"fig":"","opts":["The space lead","The project admin of the service project","The organization admin (or an admin with user access permissions)","Any agent in the Service Desk Team role"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Space lead 只是 project 的負責人欄位，沒有管授權的能力。","B":"錯。Project admin 只能把已有授權的人加進 role，不能給產品存取。","C":"對。產品存取（授權）在 Atlassian Administration 管理，由 org admin 或被授權管理使用者存取的 admin 設定。","D":"錯。Agent 可以加 customer，不能給別人產品授權。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-an-agent-to-your-service-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/unlicense-agents/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.1-e08","sec":"420.1.1","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a Jira Service Management Standard plan, the incident manager wants to add a business executive without an agent license as an incident stakeholder. What happens?","zh":"在 JSM Standard 方案，incident manager 想把一位沒有 agent 授權的高階主管加成 incident stakeholder。結果如何？","zo":["可以，因為 stakeholder 從來不需要授權","只有他在某個 customer organization 裡才可以","他要先成為 request participant","不行：Free 與 Standard 方案只有 agent 能被加成 stakeholder"],"fig":"","opts":["It works because stakeholders never need licenses","It works only if the executive is in a customer organization","It requires the executive to be a request participant first","It is not possible, because on Free and Standard plans only agents can be added as stakeholders"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不佔授權只適用 Premium、Enterprise；Standard 不是。","B":"錯。Organization 與 stakeholder 的授權規則無關。","C":"錯。Request participant 與 incident stakeholder 是不同機制。","D":"對。官方：Free、Standard 方案只有 agent 授權的使用者能被加成 incident stakeholder；Premium、Enterprise 才可以邀請任意數量、不佔授權的 stakeholder。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-users-and-roles-are-there-in-jira-service-management/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e09","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A company wants anyone on the internet to view its external help center and submit requests without logging in. Which settings are required? (Choose two.)","zh":"公司希望網路上任何人都能不登入就瀏覽外部 help center 並提單。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["Project customer permissions：Channel access 設為 Open","Permission scheme：把 Browse Projects 給 Anyone","關閉 customer sharing","Customer access：Allow customers to create accounts，並勾選「不用登入就能存取 portal 與提單」","Project customer permissions：Channel access 設為 Restricted"],"fig":"","opts":["Project customer permissions: Channel access set to Open","Permission scheme: Browse Projects granted to Anyone","Customer sharing disabled","Customer access: Allow customers to create accounts, with 'Customers can access and send requests from the portal without logging in' selected","Project customer permissions: Channel access set to Restricted"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。Project admin 把 Channel access 設成 Open，才會沿用 site 的「任何人」設定。","B":"錯。匿名 portal 存取是由 customer access 與 channel access 控制，不是在 permission scheme 給 Anyone。","C":"錯。Customer sharing 只決定 customer 能把 request 分享給誰，跟能不能匿名提單無關。","D":"對。Site admin 要允許 customer 建帳號，並勾選不用登入就能存取與提單。","E":"錯。Restricted 只讓被邀請進 project 的 customer 提單，跟「任何人」相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/how-global-permissions-affect-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e10","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A service project's channel access is set to Restricted. A user who was never invited to the project raises a request through the Slack integration. What happens?","zh":"某 service project 的 channel access 設為 Restricted。一位從沒被邀請的使用者透過 Slack 整合提單。結果？","zo":["Request 會建立，而且使用者會被自動邀請進 project","只有他在某個 organization 時才會建立","Request 會被轉成 email request","Request 被拒絕"],"fig":"","opts":["The request is created and the user is automatically invited to the project","The request is created only if the user is in an organization","The request is converted to an email request","The request is rejected"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：channel access 是 Restricted 時，使用者仍能透過 Slack、Teams 等 chat 提單，並會被自動邀請進這個 project。","B":"錯。Chat 提單不需要先在 organization 裡。","C":"錯。不會轉成 email request；它就是 chat 建立的 request。","D":"錯。Chat 管道不受 channel access 限制，不會被擋。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/change-project-customer-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e11","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The site admin selected 'Don't allow customers to create accounts'. What is a consequence?","zh":"Site admin 選了 Don't allow customers to create accounts。會造成什麼結果？","zo":["Agent 再也不能新增 customer","Customer 仍可從 help center 連結註冊","陌生寄件者的 email request 會自動建立 customer 帳號","無法辨識的 customer 寄來的 email request 不會被處理"],"fig":"","opts":["Agents can no longer add customers","Customers can still sign up through the help center link","Unknown senders' email requests create new customer accounts automatically","Email requests from unidentified customers are not processed"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Agent 與 admin 仍可以替 customer 建帳號，這正是官方說的做法。","B":"錯。這個設定會停用 sign-up 連結。","C":"錯。不允許建帳號時，系統不會替陌生寄件者建帳號。","D":"對。官方：選這個設定後 sign-up 連結停用、未知寄件者的 email request 不會被處理；customer 要先有帳號或由 agent／admin 建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/change-global-customer-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e12","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants customers to be able to choose approvers from a list when raising requests. Which customer sharing option should be selected?","zh":"Project admin 希望 customer 提單時能從清單選 approver。Customer sharing 應該選哪一個？","zo":["Customer 可以搜尋同 organization 的其他 customer","關閉 customer sharing","Customer 可以搜尋 organization，或手動輸入 email","Customer 可以搜尋同 space 或 organization 的其他 customer"],"fig":"","opts":["Customers can search for other customers within their organizations","Customer sharing disabled","Customers can search within organizations or manually enter email addresses","Customers can search for other customers within their space or organizations"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只能搜尋同 organization，approver 若不在同一個 organization 就選不到。","B":"錯。關閉分享後 customer 找不到其他人，更無法選 approver。","C":"錯。這個選項可以手動輸入 email，但官方建議「讓 customer 選 approver」時用的是可搜尋整個 space 的選項。","D":"對。官方在這個選項旁註明：想讓 customer 選 approver 時選這個設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/change-project-customer-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e13","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin creates a customer detail field called 'Contract tier' from within Service Project A. Where will this field be displayed?","zh":"Admin 在 Service Project A 裡建立名為「Contract tier」的 customer detail field。這個欄位會出現在哪裡？","zo":["JSM 所有 customer 的 profile","只在屬於某個 organization 的 customer","要加到 request type 之後才出現","只在 Service Project A 的 customer profile"],"fig":"","opts":["On all customer profiles in Jira Service Management","Only on customers who belong to an organization","Only after it is added to the request type","Only on customer profiles in Service Project A"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：建立的 detail field 會顯示在 JSM 所有 customer 的 profile，不只目前的 project。","B":"錯。Customer detail field 顯示在每一位 customer 身上，不限 organization 成員。","C":"錯。Detail field 屬於 customer profile，不需要加到 request type。","D":"錯。Detail field 不是 project 層級的設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-customer-detail-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e14","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin created an organization detail field with the type Text but now needs it to be a Single-select dropdown. What can the admin do?","zh":"Admin 建了一個 Text 類型的 organization detail field，現在需要改成 Single-select dropdown。Admin 可以怎麼做？","zo":["編輯欄位並修改類型","到 Jira custom fields 改類型","只能改 label，所以要刪除後重建","用 bulk change 工具轉換"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit the field and change its type","Change the type from Jira custom fields","Only the label can be edited, so the field must be deleted and recreated","Convert it using the bulk change tool"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方：編輯 detail field 只能改 label，不支援改類型。","B":"錯。Detail field 不是 Jira custom field，不在那裡管理。","C":"對。只能改 label；要換類型只能刪除後重建（刪除會一併移除資料）。","D":"錯。Bulk change 針對 work item，不能改 detail field 的定義。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-organization-detail-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e15","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The organization 'Acme' has the email domain acme.org added today. Which customers are automatically added to Acme? (Choose two.)","zh":"Organization「Acme」今天加上 email domain acme.org。哪些 customer 會自動加進 Acme？（選兩個）","zo":["Customer permissions 有更新、email 是 acme.org 的 customer","在使用 Acme 的 project 提單的任何 domain 的 customer","Email 是 acme.org 的 agent","明天第一次提單的新 customer user@acme.org","所有既有、email 是 acme.org 的 customer"],"fig":"","opts":["A customer whose customer permissions are updated and has an acme.org address","Customers with any email domain who raise requests in projects using Acme","Agents with acme.org addresses","A new customer user@acme.org who raises a first request tomorrow","All existing customers with acme.org addresses"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方：只有新 customer 與「customer permissions 有更新」的帳號會被歸入。","B":"錯。只有 email domain 相符的人會被歸入。","C":"錯。Organization 是 customer 的群組，自動分組針對 customer。","D":"對。加 domain 後，新加入且 email 相符的 customer 會自動成為成員。","E":"錯。官方：加 domain 不影響既有 customer。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/use-email-domains-to-automatically-group-customers-into-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.2-e16","sec":"420.1.2","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Site admin settings allow customers to create accounts. The project admin of the Payroll service project wants only customers that agents explicitly add to Payroll to be able to raise requests by portal or email. What should the project admin configure?","zh":"Site 設定允許 customer 建帳號。Payroll service project 的 project admin 希望只有 agent 明確加入的 customer 才能用 portal 或 email 提單。應該設定什麼？","zo":["Channel access：Open","關閉 customer sharing","包含 Reporter 的 issue security level","Channel access：Restricted"],"fig":"","opts":["Channel access: Open","Customer sharing: disabled","An issue security level containing Reporter","Channel access: Restricted"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Open 會沿用 site 的設定，site 允許建帳號，任何人都能進來。","B":"錯。分享設定只管 customer 能把 request 分享給誰，不限制誰能提單。","C":"錯。Issue security 控制誰看得到 request，不控制誰能提單。","D":"對。Restricted：只有被 agent 或 admin 直接邀請進這個 project 的 customer 能用 portal 與 email 提單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/change-project-customer-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e17","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin tries to invite a colleague who has never been licensed for Jira Service Management as an agent, but the invite fails. Why?","zh":"Project admin 想把一位從未取得 JSM 授權的同事邀請成 agent，但邀請失敗。為什麼？","zo":["同事必須先當 30 天 collaborator","Agent 必須透過 email request 邀請","Project admin 只能加已有 JSM 授權的 agent；只有 organization admin 能加新的 agent","Service Desk Team role 已滿"],"fig":"","opts":["The colleague must first be a collaborator for 30 days","Agents must be invited through email requests","Project admins can only add agents who already have a JSM license; only organization admins can add new agents","The Service Desk Team role is full"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。沒有這種規定。","B":"錯。Email request 是 customer 提單的管道，跟邀請 agent 無關。","C":"對。官方：space admin 只能加已經有授權的 agent；只有 organization admin 能加任何人（新的或既有的 agent）。","D":"錯。Role 沒有人數上限的概念。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-an-agent-to-your-service-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e18","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The space lead of the Facilities service project is Mia. The project admin wants new requests to be assigned to Leo by default when no other rule applies. Which approaches work? (Choose two.)","zh":"Facilities service project 的 space lead 是 Mia。Project admin 希望沒有其他規則時，新 request 預設指派給 Leo。哪些做法可行？（選兩個）","zo":["把 space lead 改成 Leo，Default assignee 設成 Space lead","加 automation rule 把新 request 指派給 Leo","把 Leo 加進 Administrators role","把 Leo 加成 request participant","在 Space settings > Details 把 Default assignee 設成 Leo"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the space lead to Leo and set Default assignee to Space lead","Add an automation rule that assigns new requests to Leo","Add Leo to the Administrators role","Add Leo as a request participant","Set Default assignee to Leo in Space settings > Details"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。把 space lead 改成 Leo，再把 default assignee 設成 Space lead。","B":"對。Automation 可以在 request 建立時指派給 Leo。","C":"錯。Role 只影響權限，不影響指派。","D":"錯。Participant 是被分享的人，不是負責人。","E":"錯。官方：default assignee 只能是 Unassigned 或 space lead，不能直接選任意人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/edit-your-service-project-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e19","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin added the Assignee field to a request type's request form with a preset value and selected Hide from portal. Customers can create requests, but the Assignee is never set. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Project admin 在某 request type 的表單加了 Assignee 欄位、設預設值並勾 Hide from portal。Customer 能建立 request，但 Assignee 永遠沒被設定。最可能的原因？","zo":["Component lead 覆蓋了它","Service Desk Customer - Portal Access 缺少 Assign Work Items 權限","Customer 需要 JSM 授權","隱藏欄位不能有預設值"],"fig":"","opts":["The component lead overrides it","The Service Desk Customer - Portal Access security type lacks the Assign Work Items permission","Customers need a JSM license","Hidden fields cannot have default values"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。題目沒有提到 component，而且明確設定的 Assignee 優先於 component lead。","B":"對。官方：Assign work items 對 customer（Portal Access）是必要權限，隱藏的 Assignee 欄位才能把 request 自動交給指定的人。","C":"錯。Customer 不需要授權。","D":"錯。隱藏欄位設預設值正是常見做法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/customize-jira-service-management-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e20","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"HR requests must only be visible to HR agents and the person who raised the request. Which configuration meets this requirement?","zh":"HR 的 request 只能讓 HR agent 與提單人看到。哪一個設定符合需求？","zo":["在 permission scheme 拿掉 customer 的 Browse Projects","關閉 customer sharing","Channel access 設為 Restricted","Issue security level 包含 HR agent 的 project role 與 Reporter，並設為預設 security level"],"fig":"","opts":["A permission scheme that removes Browse Projects from customers","Customer sharing disabled","Channel access set to Restricted","An issue security level containing the HR agents' project role and Reporter, set as the default security level"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。拿掉 customer 的 Browse Projects 會讓 customer 連 portal 都進不去，也看不到自己的 request。","B":"錯。關閉分享只防止 customer 主動分享，不能限制 agent 端誰看得到。","C":"錯。Restricted 控制誰能提單，不控制誰看得到哪一張 request。","D":"對。Issue security level 放 HR agent 的 role 與 Reporter，設成預設 level，所有新 request 就只有這兩種人看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e21","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Why do project admins often prefer to add individual users rather than groups to service project roles?","zh":"為什麼 project admin 常偏好把個別使用者而不是 group 加進 service project 的 role？","zo":["Group 不能加進 project role","Group 成員只有擁有 Administer Jira 全域權限的人能修改","Group 裡的使用者收不到通知","Group 會多佔授權"],"fig":"","opts":["Groups cannot be added to project roles","Group membership can only be edited by users with the Administer Jira global permission","Users in groups do not receive notifications","Groups consume extra licenses"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Group 可以加進 role，官方說 people and groups 都可以。","B":"對。官方：group 成員只有 Administer Jira 能改，所以 project admin 通常偏好直接把使用者加進 role，自己就能維護。","C":"錯。通知與是否透過 group 加入無關。","D":"錯。授權依產品存取計算，與 group 加入 role 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-service-project-role-memberships/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e22","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin removes Jira Service Management product access from an agent in User management. What is the result?","zh":"Jira admin 在 User management 移除某 agent 的 JSM 產品存取。結果是？","zo":["他只在目前的 service project 失去 agent 能力","他在每個 project 都變成 collaborator","授權被釋放，他在站上所有 service project 都不能再當 agent","他過去的留言被刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["The agent loses agent capabilities in only the current service project","The agent becomes a collaborator in every project","The license is released and the agent can no longer work in any service project on the site","The agent's past comments are deleted"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。授權是全站的，不是單一 project。","B":"錯。是否成為 collaborator 取決於有沒有 Jira 授權並在 Service Desk Team role，不是自動轉換。","C":"對。官方：授權被釋放、從 jira-service-project user group 移除，站上所有 service project 都不能再當 agent。","D":"錯。過去的留言不會被刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/unlicense-agents/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e23","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Users in the Sales team (licensed for Jira, not for JSM) need to view and add internal comments on IT service project requests. Which permission scheme changes meet this need with the least effort? (Choose two.)","zh":"Sales 團隊的使用者（有 Jira 授權、沒有 JSM 授權）需要檢視 IT service project 的 request 並加內部留言。哪些 permission scheme 調整最省事？（選兩個）","zo":["給 Sales JSM 產品存取","把 Browse Projects 給 Application access：Any logged in user","把 Add Comments 給 Application access：Any logged in user","把 Administer Projects 給 Sales group","把 Sales 加到 Service Desk Customers role"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant JSM product access to Sales","Grant Browse Projects to Application access: Any logged in user","Grant Add Comments to Application access: Any logged in user","Grant Administer Projects to the Sales group","Add Sales to the Service Desk Customers role"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。給 JSM 授權會變成 agent、佔授權，不是最少成本。","B":"對。官方做法：Browse Projects 給 Any logged in user，其他 Jira 使用者就能看 service project 的 work item。","C":"對。Add Comments 給 Any logged in user；他們只能 internal comment，不能分享給 customer。","D":"錯。Administer Projects 遠超需求。","E":"錯。放進 customers role 他們就只是 customer，只能從 portal 看自己的 request。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/give-jira-users-permission-to-view-service-project-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/jira-user-permission-to-comment-on-service-project-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.1.3-e24","sec":"420.1.3","dom":"420.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A customer can create requests in the portal but cannot see them afterward in 'My requests'. Other permissions are standard. What should the admin check first?","zh":"Customer 能在 portal 建立 request，但之後在「My requests」看不到。其他權限都是標準設定。Admin 應該先檢查什麼？","zo":["套在 request 上的 issue security level 有沒有包含 Reporter","Customer 有沒有 JSM 授權","Request type 有沒有在 portal group 裡","Customer 在不在 Administrators role"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the issue security level applied to the requests includes Reporter","Whether the customer has a JSM license","Whether the request type is in a portal group","Whether the customer is in the Administrators role"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方提醒：有 issue security scheme 時要確認 service desk 使用者看得到 work item，否則 customer 能建立卻看不到；最常見是 level 沒包含 Reporter。","B":"錯。Customer 不需要授權。","C":"錯。Request type 不在 portal group 會讓 customer 根本無法從 portal 提這種單，跟「建得出來卻看不到」不符。","D":"錯。Customer 不該在 Administrators role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/customize-jira-service-management-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e01","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two teams, Network and Desktop Support, work in the same service project. Each team wants to see only its own set of queues in the sidebar, and some queues are shared by both teams. What should the project admin configure?","zh":"Network 與 Desktop Support 兩個團隊在同一個 service project 工作。各自只想在側欄看到自己的 queue，而且有些 queue 兩隊共用。Project admin 應該設定什麼？","zo":["每個團隊各一個用 currentUser() 的 queue","兩個分開的 service project","Priority groups，並把共用的 queue 同時放進兩個 group","每位 agent 各自 star queue"],"fig":"","opts":["One queue per team using currentUser()","Two separate service projects","Priority groups, assigning shared queues to both groups","Starred queues for every agent"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。currentUser() 針對「指派給我的」動態 queue，不能表達「這個團隊的一組 queue」。","B":"錯。拆成兩個 project 會讓共用的 queue、SLA、request type 都要維護兩份，代價太大。","C":"對。Priority group 讓每個團隊切換到自己的 queue 組合，而且一個 queue 可以同時放進多個 group。","D":"錯。Star 是個人偏好，無法讓整個團隊統一看到一組 queue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/prioritize-your-queues-by-using-groups/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e02","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Agents report that the count on the 'Hardware returns' queue never updates. The queue works when opened. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Agent 反映「Hardware returns」queue 的數字從不更新，但打開 queue 內容正常。最可能的原因？","zo":["這個 queue 沒放進 priority group 也沒被 star，所以在 View all queues 裡","這個 queue 超過 300 個 work item","Queue 的 JQL 用了 ORDER BY","Agent 缺少 Browse Projects 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The queue is not in a priority group or starred, so it appears under View all queues","The queue has more than 300 work items","The queue's JQL uses ORDER BY","Agents lack the Browse Projects permission"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：只有 Starred 與 priority group 內的 queue 會定期刷新數字；View all queues 裡的不刷新、預設收合。","B":"錯。300 是每個 work category 的 queue 數上限，不是 work item 數；work item 數到 999 會顯示 999+。","C":"錯。排序不會影響數字刷新。","D":"錯。沒有 Browse Projects 的話連 queue 內容都看不到，跟題目「打開正常」矛盾。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/prioritize-your-queues-by-using-groups/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/best-practices-for-managing-queues-at-scale/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e03","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL returns unresolved requests that will breach their resolution SLA within the next two hours, excluding requests that have already breached?","zh":"哪一段 JQL 能找出「兩小時內將違反 resolution SLA、但尚未違約」的未解決 request？","zo":["\"Time to resolution\" = breached()","\"Time to resolution\" < remaining(\"2h\") AND \"Time to resolution\" != breached() AND resolution = Unresolved","\"Time to resolution\" > elapsed(\"2h\")","\"Time to resolution\" < remaining(\"2h\")"],"fig":"","opts":["\"Time to resolution\" = breached()","\"Time to resolution\" < remaining(\"2h\") AND \"Time to resolution\" != breached() AND resolution = Unresolved","\"Time to resolution\" > elapsed(\"2h\")","\"Time to resolution\" < remaining(\"2h\")"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。breached() 只找已經違約的，正好相反。","B":"對。remaining 找兩小時內到期的，再用 != breached() 排除已違約的，並限定未解決。","C":"錯。elapsed 量的是從 SLA 開始到現在過了多久，不是距離目標還剩多久。","D":"錯。remaining(\"2h\") 也包含已違約（剩餘時間為負）的 request，題目要排除它們。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/write-jql-queries-for-slas/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e04","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants a queue that shows requests reported by customers whose customer detail 'Region' is 'APAC'. Which JQL is valid?","zh":"Project admin 要建一個 queue，顯示 customer detail「Region」為「APAC」的 customer 所提的 request。哪段 JQL 有效？","zo":["customerDetail(\"Region\") = \"APAC\"","organizations ~ \"APAC\"","reporter = customerDetail(\"Region\", \"APAC\")","reporter in customerDetail(\"Region\", \"APAC\")"],"fig":"","opts":["customerDetail(\"Region\") = \"APAC\"","organizations ~ \"APAC\"","reporter = customerDetail(\"Region\", \"APAC\")","reporter in customerDetail(\"Region\", \"APAC\")"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。語法不對：函數要兩個參數，而且放在 IN 的右邊。","B":"錯。這是對 organization 名稱做文字比對，不是依 customer detail 篩選。","C":"錯。customerDetail() 不支援 = 運算子。","D":"對。customerDetail() 只支援 IN 與 NOT IN，搭配 reporter、assignee、watcher 等使用者欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-queues-based-on-customer-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e05","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A large service project has a queue using text ~ \"printer\" to collect printer issues. The queue is slow and inaccurate. What does Atlassian recommend? (Choose two.)","zh":"大型 service project 用 text ~ \"printer\" 建了一個印表機問題的 queue，又慢又不準。Atlassian 建議怎麼做？（選兩個）","zo":["在文字搜尋加更多 OR 條件","用 automation 加 component 或 label，再依分類建 queue","調高 queue 的刷新間隔","把 queue 移到 View all queues","用 request type 或隱藏欄位，讓 customer 提單時就分類"],"fig":"","opts":["Add more OR clauses to the text search","Use automation to apply a component or label, then build the queue on that category","Increase the queue refresh interval","Move the queue into View all queues","Use a request type or hidden field so customers categorize requests when they create them"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。更多文字條件只會讓查詢更慢。","B":"對。官方也建議用 automation 自動加 component 或 label，queue 再依這些欄位篩選。","C":"錯。Queue 沒有可調整的刷新間隔設定。","D":"錯。移到 View all queues 只是不刷新數字，不會讓分類變準。","E":"對。官方建議在提單時就用 request type 與隱藏欄位分類，再依分類建 queue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/best-practices-for-managing-queues-at-scale/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e06","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Several agents each created a personal queue showing their own assigned requests, and the sidebar is now cluttered and slow. What is the recommended approach?","zh":"好幾位 agent 各自建了顯示自己被指派 request 的個人 queue，側欄變得雜亂又慢。建議做法是？","zo":["建一個 assignee = currentUser() 的 queue，請 agent star 它","把每個個人 queue 各放進自己的 priority group","替每位 agent 各開一個 service project","刪掉所有 queue、只用 filter"],"fig":"","opts":["Create one queue using assignee = currentUser() and ask agents to star it","Move each personal queue into its own priority group","Give each agent a separate service project","Delete all queues and use filters only"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方建議用 currentUser() 建一個動態、個人化的 queue，再鼓勵 agent star 自己相關的 queue。","B":"錯。每人一個 group 仍然是一堆 queue，而且每個 group 的 queue 都會刷新，更拖慢效能。","C":"錯。為了個人清單拆 project 完全不合理。","D":"錯。Queue 是 agent 的主要工作入口，全部改用 filter 會失去 SLA 欄位與 queue 操作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/best-practices-for-managing-queues-at-scale/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e07","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create, edit, and reorder queues in a company-managed service project?","zh":"在 company-managed service project 中，誰能建立、編輯、排序 queue？","zo":["有 portal 存取的 customer","任何 agent","只有 Jira administrator","Project（space）administrator"],"fig":"","opts":["Customers with portal access","Any agent","Only Jira administrators","Project (space) administrators"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Customer 根本看不到 queue。","B":"錯。Agent 可以使用與 star queue，但不能建立或修改共用的 queue。","C":"錯。不一定要 Jira admin；project admin 就可以管理 queue。","D":"對。官方：建立新 queue 要 space admin；編輯 queue 要 project admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-a-new-queue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/edit-queues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.1-e08","sec":"420.2.1","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A queue shows 999+ instead of an exact count. What does this indicate?","zh":"某 queue 顯示 999+ 而不是精確數字。代表什麼？","zo":["Project 已達 queue 數量上限","Queue 至少有 999 個 work item；數字只算到 999","SLA calendar 設定錯誤","Queue 壞了，必須重建"],"fig":"","opts":["The project reached its queue limit","The queue contains at least 999 work items; counts stop at 999","The SLA calendar is misconfigured","The queue is broken and must be recreated"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Queue 數量上限是每個 work category 300 個，跟 999+ 無關。","B":"對。官方：queue 的數字只算到 999，之後顯示 999+；建議縮小範圍（例如只看最近更新的）。","C":"錯。數字顯示與 SLA calendar 無關。","D":"錯。這是正常的顯示上限，不是錯誤。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-queues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e09","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Requirement: Time to resolution is 4 hours for VIP organizations and 8 hours for everyone else, counted only during business hours, and paused while waiting for the customer. Which configuration is correct?","zh":"需求：Time to resolution 對 VIP organization 是 4 小時、其他人 8 小時；只算上班時間；等待 customer 時暫停。哪一個設定正確？","zo":["兩個分開的 SLA（VIP、Others），都用 24/7 calendar","所有 work item 一個 goal，再用 automation 把 VIP 的時間減半","VIP goal 放在「All remaining work items」goal 下面","一個 VIP 的 JQL goal，下面放「All remaining work items」goal，都用上班時段 calendar，並設 Waiting for customer 的 pause 條件"],"fig":"","opts":["Two separate SLAs named VIP and Others with 24/7 calendars","One goal for all work items, plus an automation rule that halves the time for VIP","A VIP goal placed below the 'All remaining work items' goal","One goal with JQL for VIP and a second 'All remaining work items' goal below it, each using a business-hours calendar, with a pause condition on Waiting for customer"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。24/7 calendar 會在非上班時間繼續計時；而且同一個指標拆成兩個 SLA 也不好維護。","B":"錯。Automation 不能改 SLA 的目標時間；目標應由 goal 定義。","C":"錯。Goal 由上而下比對，VIP 放在兜底 goal 下面永遠不會被用到。","D":"對。具體的 VIP goal 放上面、兜底 goal 放下面，搭配工作時段 calendar 與 Waiting for customer 的 pause 條件，完整符合需求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-sla-goals/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-sla-conditions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-sla-calendars/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e10","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin created an SLA named 'Time to first reponse' with a typo. How can the name be corrected?","zh":"Admin 建了一個名稱打錯字的 SLA「Time to first reponse」。怎麼修正名稱？","zo":["到 Custom fields 改底層欄位名稱","用 SLA calendar 設定","編輯 SLA 改名","建立後不能改名；用正確名稱建立新 SLA"],"fig":"","opts":["Rename the underlying custom field in Custom fields","Use the SLA calendar settings","Edit the SLA and rename it","The name cannot be changed after creation; create a new SLA with the correct name"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。SLA 名稱存成 SLA CustomField Type 的 custom field，但官方明說建立後不能改名；要另建新 SLA，舊欄位可用 Clean up 清掉。","B":"錯。Calendar 只管工作時段。","C":"錯。官方：SLA 建立後無法改名。","D":"對。只能用正確名稱建立新的 SLA（必要時清理舊的 SLA 欄位）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-an-sla/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/clean-up-unused-custom-sla-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e11","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Some incidents in a service project show no 'Time to resolution' SLA at all, while others do. The SLA has two goals: priority = Highest (2h) and priority = High (4h). What is the most likely cause?","zh":"某 service project 有些 incident 完全沒有「Time to resolution」SLA，有些有。SLA 只有兩個 goal：priority = Highest（2h）、priority = High（4h）。最可能的原因？","zo":["這些 incident 是 email 建立的","SLA calendar 有假日","Medium、Low priority 的 incident 不符合任何 goal，所以 SLA 不套用","SLA 名稱太長"],"fig":"","opts":["The incidents were created by email","The SLA calendar has holidays","The incidents with Medium or Low priority match no goal, so the SLA does not apply","The SLA name is too long"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。提單管道不影響 SLA 是否套用，除非 goal 的 JQL 以管道篩選。","B":"錯。假日只影響計時，不會讓 SLA 消失。","C":"對。沒有任何 goal 的 JQL 符合時，該 work item 就沒有這個 SLA；解法是補一個涵蓋 Medium／Low 的 goal，或替 All remaining work items 設定 time target（設成 No target 也不會顯示）。","D":"錯。名稱長度與是否套用無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/use-priority-to-group-sla-goals/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/slas-configured-in-the-service-project-are-not-displayed-on-the-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e12","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An agent changes an open request's priority from Critical to Blocker. What happens to its running SLA?","zh":"Agent 把一張開啟中 request 的 priority 從 Critical 改成 Blocker。進行中的 SLA 會怎樣？","zo":["已計時間沿用到新 priority 的目標","沒有變化，目標在建立時就固定","SLA 從零重新開始","SLA 被丟棄"],"fig":"","opts":["Time already tracked counts toward the new priority's goal","Nothing; the goal is fixed at creation","The SLA restarts from zero","The SLA is discarded"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：priority 改變時，已經計算的時間沿用到新目標，剩餘時間依新 priority 重算。","B":"錯。開啟中的 SLA 會隨 work item 資料變化而調整。","C":"錯。官方：除非影響 start／stop 條件，SLA 不會重新開始。","D":"錯。只改 priority 不會丟棄 cycle。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-an-sla/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e13","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A team works 09:00–12:00 and 13:00–18:00 Monday to Friday in Singapore and observes national holidays. How should the SLA calendar be configured? (Choose two.)","zh":"團隊在新加坡、週一到週五 09:00–12:00 與 13:00–18:00 上班，並放國定假日。SLA calendar 該怎麼設？（選兩個）","zo":["使用 24/7 calendar","為午休加 pause condition","工作時段設 09:00–18:00，午休請 agent 自己停時鐘","時區設為新加坡","每個工作日加兩個時段"],"fig":"","opts":["Use a 24/7 calendar","Add a pause condition for lunch","Set working hours 09:00–18:00 and rely on agents to stop the clock at lunch","Set the time zone to Singapore","Add two time slots for each working day"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。24/7 會在下班與假日繼續計時。","B":"錯。Pause condition 依 work item 的狀態或事件，不是依時段；午休應在 calendar 處理。","C":"錯。Agent 無法手動停 SLA 時鐘，這樣會把午休算進去。","D":"對。Calendar 要設時區，SLA 才會依新加坡時間計算。","E":"對。官方：用 ＋ 在同一天加多段時間，例如午休前後各一段。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-sla-calendars/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e14","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An SLA has three goals with priority groupings. How many goals does a goal with five priority time targets count as toward the 90-goal limit?","zh":"SLA 的 goal 用 priority 分組。一個含五個 priority 時間目標的 goal，佔用 90 個 goal 上限中的幾個？","zo":["五個","一個","零個","九十個"],"fig":"","opts":["Five","One","Zero","Ninety"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Priority 時間目標不各自算一個 goal。","B":"對。官方：在 goal 下用 priority 分組仍只算 1 個 goal；90 個 goal × 5 個 priority＝450 個時間目標。","C":"錯。Goal 本身仍算一個。","D":"錯。90 是上限，不是一個 goal 的計數。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/use-priority-to-group-sla-goals/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.2-e15","sec":"420.2.2","dom":"420.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A 'Time to first response' SLA should stop when an agent first replies to the customer, and should not count time while the request waits for customer input. Which conditions fit? (Choose two.)","zh":"「Time to first response」SLA 應在 agent 第一次回覆 customer 時停止，並在等待 customer 時不計時。哪些條件適合？（選兩個）","zo":["Stop：Entered status: Resolved","Pause on：Status: Waiting for customer","Start：Comment: By customer","Pause on：Resolution: Not set","Stop：Comment: For customers"],"fig":"","opts":["Stop: Entered status: Resolved","Pause on: Status: Waiting for customer","Start: Comment: By customer","Pause on: Resolution: Not set","Stop: Comment: For customers"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Resolved 適合 Time to resolution，不是首次回覆。","B":"對。等 customer 回覆時暫停是標準做法。","C":"錯。First response 通常從 work item 建立開始計時。","D":"錯。Resolution 未設定是大多數開啟中 request 的狀態，用它暫停會讓 SLA 幾乎不計時。","E":"對。首次回覆＝agent 第一次留給 customer 看的留言。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-sla-conditions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e16","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An IT team on JSM Standard wants change management with a change calendar and CAB approvals. What is required?","zh":"使用 JSM Standard 的 IT 團隊想要有 change calendar 與 CAB 核准的 change management。需要什麼？","zo":["安裝 Marketplace app","在 Feature lab 開啟","在 Features 頁開啟 Changes work category","升級到 Premium 或 Enterprise"],"fig":"","opts":["Install a Marketplace app","Enable it in the Feature lab","Enable the Changes work category on the Features page","Upgrade to Premium or Enterprise"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。題目問的是 JSM 內建功能的方案需求。","B":"錯。Feature lab 是試用新功能，不是繞過方案限制。","C":"錯。自 2024/10/16 起 change management 與 change calendar 只有 Premium／Enterprise 有。","D":"對。Change management（含 change calendar）只在 Premium、Enterprise。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/updating-your-incident-problem-and-change-management-capabilities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e17","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The HR service project (not an ITSM project) wants to receive alerts and manage on-call. Which features can be enabled, and by whom?","zh":"HR service project（不是 ITSM project）想接收 alert 並管理 on-call。可以開哪些功能、由誰開？","zo":["Services、Alerts、On-call，由 project admin 開","Alerts 與 On-call，由 Jira admin 開","只有 Services，由 org admin 開","都不行，operations 功能只限 ITSM"],"fig":"","opts":["Services, Alerts, and On-call, by the project admin","Alerts and On-call, by a Jira admin","Only Services, by an org admin","None; operations features are ITSM-only"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Services 只在 ITSM project 提供。","B":"對。官方：Alerts 與 On-call 所有 project 類型都能開；在非 ITSM project 開這些功能要 Jira admin。","C":"錯。Services 只有 ITSM 才有，而且開關不由 org admin 處理。","D":"錯。Alerts 與 On-call 可以在任何類型的 project 開。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-services-alerts-and-on-call-to-your-navigation-sidebar/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e18","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Recurring outages of the payment API keep generating similar incidents. The team wants to investigate the root cause separately from restoring service. Which work category fits?","zh":"Payment API 一再中斷，持續產生類似的 incident。團隊想把「找根本原因」與「恢復服務」分開處理。該用哪個 work category？","zo":["Incidents","Problems","Changes","Service requests"],"fig":"","opts":["Incidents","Problems","Changes","Service requests"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Incident 的目標是盡快恢復服務，不是找根本原因。","B":"對。Problem management 專門找出一再發生的 incident 的根本原因。","C":"錯。Change 是要審核、排程的變更；修復根因後可能會開 change，但調查本身是 problem。","D":"錯。Service request 是例行請求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/updating-your-incident-problem-and-change-management-capabilities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e19","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An incident's linked alert priority is raised from P3 to P1. What happens?","zh":"某 incident 連結的 alert priority 從 P3 提高到 P1。會發生什麼？","zo":["該 alert 的通知流程重新開始","Incident 自動被解決","Alert 被轉給 No one","什麼都不會，alert priority 是固定的"],"fig":"","opts":["The notification flow for the alert restarts","The incident is automatically resolved","The alert is routed to No one","Nothing; alert priority is fixed"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：新的 priority 高於原本時，該 alert 的通知流程會重新開始。","B":"錯。Priority 變更不會解決 incident。","C":"錯。Priority 提高反而更需要通知，不會轉給 No one。","D":"錯。Alert priority 可以更新。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-alert-priorities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e20","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Where does an admin map incident priorities to alert priorities in a service project?","zh":"Admin 在 service project 的哪裡把 incident priority 對應到 alert priority？","zo":["Space settings > Operations > Incident management > Assign alert priorities","Jira settings > Issues > Priorities","Space settings > Request types","Queue settings"],"fig":"","opts":["Space settings > Operations > Incident management > Assign alert priorities","Jira settings > Issues > Priorities","Space settings > Request types","Queue settings"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方路徑：Space settings → Operations → Incident management → Assign alert priorities。","B":"錯。那裡管理 priority 本身（名稱、圖示），不是 alert 對應。","C":"錯。Request types 管提單表單。","D":"錯。Queue settings 管 queue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-alert-priorities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e21","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A project admin wants to trial a new JSM capability that is not yet generally available. Where, and what should they expect? (Choose two.)","zh":"Project admin 想試用尚未正式推出的 JSM 新功能。要去哪裡、應該預期什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["功能可能經常變動，或最後不會推出","Jira settings > System > Labs","Feature lab 的功能保證會成為正式功能","需要 Marketplace 授權","Space settings > Features > Feature lab"],"fig":"","opts":["The feature may change frequently or might never be released","Jira settings > System > Labs","Feature lab features are guaranteed to become permanent","It requires a Marketplace license","Space settings > Features > Feature lab"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方：lab 功能是進行中的作品，可能常改變，甚至不會正式推出。","B":"錯。沒有這個位置。","C":"錯。官方明說可能不會正式推出。","D":"錯。Feature lab 是內建功能。","E":"對。Feature lab 在 Space settings → Features 頁最下方，用開關在 project 啟用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-is-the-feature-lab/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.3-e22","sec":"420.2.3","dom":"420.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A company downgrades from JSM Premium to Standard. What happens to existing change requests? (Choose two.)","zh":"公司從 JSM Premium 降到 Standard。既有的 change request 會怎樣？（選兩個）","zo":["30 天唯讀後被移除","被刪除","它們的 request type 移到 Unassigned 分類","Work item 移到 All queues 區塊","被轉成 incident"],"fig":"","opts":["They become read-only for 30 days and are then removed","They are deleted","Their request types move to the Unassigned category","The work items move into the All queues section","They are converted to incidents"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。沒有這種刪除機制。","B":"錯。官方：不會遺失資料。","C":"對。Changes、Problems、PIR 的 request type 會變成 Unassigned。","D":"對。這些 work item 會移到 All queues。","E":"錯。不會被轉成 incident。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/updating-your-incident-problem-and-change-management-capabilities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e23","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Low-priority P5 alerts from a monitoring tool should be recorded but must not notify anyone. What should the team admin configure?","zh":"監控工具送來的低優先 P5 alert 要留紀錄、但不能通知任何人。Team admin 應該設定什麼？","zo":["On-call schedule 的 No one override","刪除 integration","延遲 24 小時的 escalation policy","把 P5 alert route 到 No one 的 routing rule"],"fig":"","opts":["An on-call schedule override with No one","Delete the integration","An escalation policy with a 24-hour delay","A routing rule that routes P5 alerts to No one"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Override 改的是某段時間的值班者，會影響所有 alert，不只 P5。","B":"錯。刪掉 integration 就連紀錄都沒有了。","C":"錯。延遲 24 小時仍然會通知。","D":"對。官方：route 到 No one 會記錄 alert 但不通知，例如低優先（P4、P5）的 alert。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-routing-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e24","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team routes all alerts directly to its on-call schedule. An alert goes unacknowledged for an hour, and nobody else is notified. Why?","zh":"某團隊把所有 alert 直接 route 到 on-call schedule。有個 alert 一小時沒人 acknowledge，也沒通知其他人。為什麼？","zo":["Route 到 schedule 只通知值班者，不會 escalate","Schedule 沒有 override","Alert policy 被停用","Rotation 頻率是每週"],"fig":"","opts":["Routing to a schedule notifies the on-call members but does not escalate","The schedule has no overrides","Alert policies are disabled","The rotation frequency is weekly"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：route 到 schedule 只通知當下值班者，沒人 acknowledge 也不會 escalate；要往上通知就 route 到 escalation policy。","B":"錯。Override 只是換班，跟 escalate 無關。","C":"錯。Alert policy 在建立時改屬性，跟沒人回應後的 escalation 無關。","D":"錯。Frequency 決定換班頻率，不影響 escalation。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-routing-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e25","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On JSM Premium, a team has three routing rules. An incoming alert matches rules 2 and 3. Which is applied?","zh":"在 JSM Premium，某團隊有三條 routing rule。進來的 alert 同時符合第 2 與第 3 條。套用哪一條？","zo":["第 3 條，因為它最新","第 2 條，因為由上而下評估、只套用第一個符合的","都不套用，衝突的規則會被略過","兩條都套用"],"fig":"","opts":["Rule 3, because it is the most recent","Rule 2, because rules are evaluated top-down and only the first match applies","Neither; conflicting rules are skipped","Both rules"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。順序看畫面上的位置，不是建立時間。","B":"對。官方：routing rules 依 UI 上的順序由上而下評估，只套用第一個符合的。","C":"錯。不會跳過，第一個符合的就生效。","D":"錯。一個 alert 只套用一條 routing rule。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-routing-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e26","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An on-call engineer is on vacation next week. What is the best way to cover their shifts without changing the base rotation?","zh":"某值班工程師下週休假。不改 base rotation 的前提下，最好怎麼處理他的班？","zo":["為下週另建一個 schedule","把 routing rule 改成 No one","編輯 rotation 把他移除","針對那段時間建立 schedule override，指定代班的人"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a new schedule for next week","Change the routing rule to No one","Edit the rotation and remove the engineer","Create a schedule override for that time range with a substitute"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。新建 schedule 太重，而且 routing 還要跟著改。","B":"錯。No one 會讓那段時間沒人收到 alert。","C":"錯。改 rotation 會影響之後所有輪值，休假結束還要改回來。","D":"對。Override 只在指定時段蓋一層，base 不變；Final 層會記錄實際值班者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/override-an-on-call-schedule/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e27","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which escalation policy capabilities are unavailable on JSM Free and Standard plans? (Choose two.)","zh":"JSM Free 與 Standard 方案的 escalation policy 不能用哪些功能？（選兩個）","zo":["通知特定使用者","Alert 被 acknowledge 後停止 escalation","通知 schedule 的值班者","通知 schedule 的下一位","重複 escalation"],"fig":"","opts":["Notify a specific user","Stop escalation when the alert is acknowledged","Notify on-call users in a schedule","Notify next user in schedule","Repeat the escalation"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。通知指定使用者是基本功能。","B":"錯。Acknowledge 後停止是預設行為。","C":"錯。通知 schedule 的值班者是基本功能。","D":"對。官方：Free、Standard 沒有 Notify next user in schedule。","E":"對。Repeat 也只在 Premium、Enterprise。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-escalation-policies/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e28","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Alerts containing the tag 'database' should have their priority raised to P1 and be assigned to the DBA team before they are created. What should be configured?","zh":"含有 tag「database」的 alert 要在建立前把 priority 提高到 P1，並指派給 DBA team。應該設定什麼？","zo":["Alert policy","Routing rule","SLA goal","Queue"],"fig":"","opts":["An alert policy","A routing rule","An SLA goal","A queue"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Alert policy 在 alert 建立時修改屬性（priority、responders 等），正好符合「建立前改 priority 並指定 team」。","B":"錯。Routing rule 決定通知哪個 escalation 或 schedule，不改 alert 的 priority。","C":"錯。SLA 量 request 的處理時間。","D":"錯。Queue 只是 request 清單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-alert-policies/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.2.4-e29","sec":"420.2.4","dom":"420.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An alert matches both a global alert policy and a team alert policy. Which statement is correct?","zh":"某 alert 同時符合 global alert policy 與 team alert policy。哪個敘述正確？","zo":["兩者都被忽略","最近編輯的 policy 勝出","Team policy 先評估並勝出","Global policy 先評估，global 優先"],"fig":"","opts":["Both are ignored","The most recently edited policy wins","The team policy is evaluated first and wins","Global policies are evaluated first, and the global policy takes precedence"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。符合就會套用。","B":"錯。順序與編輯時間無關。","C":"錯。順序相反。","D":"對。官方：先評估 global（由上而下），再評估 team；同時符合時 global 優先。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-alert-policies/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.1-e01","sec":"420.3.1","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In Assets, 'Laptop' groups items such as 'MacBook-0042' and 'ThinkPad-0107', each with Serial number and Owner. What are 'Laptop', 'MacBook-0042', and 'Owner' respectively?","zh":"在 Assets 中，「Laptop」把「MacBook-0042」「ThinkPad-0107」這類項目歸成一組，每筆都有 Serial number 與 Owner。「Laptop」「MacBook-0042」「Owner」分別是什麼？","zo":["Object、object type、attribute","Object type、attribute、object","Object schema、object、attribute","Object type、object、attribute"],"fig":"","opts":["Object, object type, attribute","Object type, attribute, object","Object schema, object, attribute","Object type, object, attribute"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。順序顛倒了：群組是 object type，具體項目才是 object。","B":"錯。MacBook-0042 是具體項目（object），Owner 才是 attribute。","C":"錯。Object schema 是更上層的容器（例如 IT Assets），Laptop 是其中一種 object type。","D":"對。Laptop 是同類 object 的群組（object type），MacBook-0042 是具體的一筆（object），Owner 是描述它的欄位（attribute）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/assets/docs/what-are-object-types/","https://support.atlassian.com/assets/docs/what-are-attributes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.1-e02","sec":"420.3.1","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Agents want to see which server is affected on each incident, and when they open the server, see every incident linked to it. What should be added to the incident request type?","zh":"Agent 想在每張 incident 看到受影響的 server，並在打開 server 時看到所有連結到它的 incident。Incident 的 request type 應該加什麼？","zo":["連到該 server 的 Confluence 頁面","填 server 名稱的 labels 欄位","限定 Servers object type 的 Assets object custom field","每台 server 一個 component"],"fig":"","opts":["A link to a Confluence page about the server","A labels field containing the server name","An Assets object custom field scoped to the Servers object type","A component per server"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Confluence 連結是單向的文件參考，不能從 server 查到所有 incident。","B":"錯。Label 只是文字標記，不會連到 server 資料，也無法從 server 端看到相關 incident。","C":"對。Assets object 欄位會在 work item 與 object 之間建立雙向連結：incident 上看到 server，server 頁看到所有相關 work item。","D":"錯。Component 用來分流與指派，不是設備清單，也沒有 server 的屬性資料。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/assets/docs/what-is-the-assets-objects-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.1-e03","sec":"420.3.1","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On the portal, customers should only see laptops whose Owner attribute is the person raising the request. Which configuration of the Assets object field achieves this?","zh":"在 portal 上，customer 只能看到 Owner attribute 是提單人本人的筆電。Assets object 欄位要怎麼設定？","zo":["在 portal 隱藏這個欄位","Filter scope（AQL）：objectType = \"Laptop\" AND Owner = currentUser()","Filter work scope（AQL）：objectType = \"Laptop\" AND Owner LIKE ${reporter.label}","Object schema：只有 Laptops"],"fig":"","opts":["Hide the field from the portal","Filter scope (AQL): objectType = \"Laptop\" AND Owner = currentUser()","Filter work scope (AQL): objectType = \"Laptop\" AND Owner LIKE ${reporter.label}","Object schema: Laptops only"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。隱藏欄位後 customer 根本選不了自己的筆電。","B":"錯。Filter scope 不能使用 placeholder，也不能依目前 work item 的提單人過濾。","C":"對。Filter work scope 能用 ${reporter.label} 這類 placeholder，依目前 work item 的欄位（提單人）過濾 object。","D":"錯。Object schema 只能限定資料來源的 schema，不能依提單人過濾。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/assets/docs/configure-the-assets-object-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.1-e04","sec":"420.3.1","dom":"420.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"An admin sets the object type 'Hardware' as abstract, with child types 'Laptop' and 'Monitor'. What is true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Admin 把 object type「Hardware」設成 abstract，child type 有「Laptop」與「Monitor」。哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Abstract type 不能有 child","不能直接在 Hardware 建立 object","Laptop 與 Monitor 可以繼承 Hardware 的 attributes","Hardware 的 object 對 agent 隱藏","Laptop 可以有多個 parent object type"],"fig":"","opts":["Abstract types cannot have children","Objects cannot be created directly in Hardware","Laptop and Monitor can inherit Hardware's attributes","Hardware objects are hidden from agents","Laptop can have multiple parent object types"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Abstract 的用意就是把 attributes 傳給 child。","B":"對。Abstract object type 不能包含自己的 object。","C":"對。開啟繼承後，child object type 會自動取得 parent 的 attributes。","D":"錯。Abstract 本身沒有 object，談不上隱藏。","E":"錯。官方：每個 object type 只能有一個 parent。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/assets/docs/what-are-object-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.1-e05","sec":"420.3.1","dom":"420.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which attributes does every Assets object include by default? (Choose two.)","zh":"每個 Assets object 預設都有哪些 attributes？（選兩個）","zo":["Owner","Created","Status","Serial number","不能修改的 Key"],"fig":"","opts":["Owner","Created","Status","Serial number","Key, which cannot be changed"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Owner 是常見的自訂 attribute，不是預設。","B":"對。Created 是預設 attribute，記錄建立時間、不能改。","C":"錯。Status 要自己加。","D":"錯。Serial number 是自訂 attribute。","E":"對。Key 由 schema key 加數字組成，不能修改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/assets/docs/what-are-attributes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.2-e06","sec":"420.3.2","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When any incident affects a Tier 1 service, the CTO must receive an email automatically. What should be configured?","zh":"任何 incident 影響到 Tier 1 service 時，CTO 必須自動收到 email。應該設定什麼？","zo":["篩選 Tier 1 service 的 queue","把 service tier 設成 Tier 1，CTO 就會自動被通知","把 CTO 加成該 service 的 change approver","Automation rule：Affected services condition 判斷 Tier 1，再 Send email"],"fig":"","opts":["A queue filtered on Tier 1 services","Set the service tier to Tier 1; the CTO is notified automatically","Add the CTO as the service's change approver","An automation rule with an Affected services condition for Tier 1 and a Send email action"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Queue 只是清單，不會主動通知。","B":"錯。Tier 只是標記關鍵程度，本身不會寄信。","C":"錯。Change approver 負責核准 change，不會因 incident 收到通知。","D":"對。官方：service tier 可當 automation 的條件，例如 Tier 1 受影響時寄信給特定的人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-service-tiers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.2-e07","sec":"420.3.2","dom":"420.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"An incident manager adds the 'Payments API' service to an incident's Affected services field. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Incident manager 把「Payments API」service 加到 incident 的 Affected services 欄位。哪些敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["依已設定的 references，incident 上會顯示上下游 service","Service 的 owner team 會自動被通知","Incident priority 會依 service tier 自動設定","要通知 owner team，必須把他們加成 responder","Incident 會被移到 service owner 的 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Upstream and downstream services appear on the incident based on mapped references","The service's owner team is automatically notified","The incident priority is automatically set from the service tier","Owner teams must be added as responders to be notified","The incident is moved to the service owner's project"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。加入 service 後，依已設定的 references 顯示上下游依賴。","B":"錯。官方：加 service 不會自動通知 owner team。","C":"錯。官方：tier 不會自動決定 priority，要寫 automation。","D":"對。要通知 owner team，必須明確把他們加成 responder。","E":"錯。Work item 不會被搬到其他 project。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/how-services-work-with-incidents/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.2-e08","sec":"420.3.2","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which service attribute is purely a categorization label with no technical impact?","zh":"Service 的哪個屬性純粹是分類標籤、沒有技術影響？","zo":["Change approvers","Type","References","Tier"],"fig":"","opts":["Change approvers","Type","References","Tier"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Change approvers 決定誰核准 change。","B":"對。官方：type 只是幫忙分類 service 性質的標籤，沒有技術影響。","C":"錯。References 決定依賴關係與影響範圍。","D":"錯。Tier 可以觸發 automation 與 alert。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-is-services/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.2-e09","sec":"420.3.2","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A legal team's service project (not ITSM) wants to use Services. What is the outcome?","zh":"法務團隊的 service project（非 ITSM）想使用 Services。結果是？","zo":["Project admin 可以在 Features 頁開啟 Services","Services 只提供給 ITSM project","Jira admin 可以替任何類型的 project 開 Services","Services 要從 Feature lab 開"],"fig":"","opts":["The project admin can enable Services on the Features page","Services are only available for ITSM projects","A Jira admin can enable Services for any project type","Services require the Feature lab"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。非 ITSM project 的 Features 頁沒有 Services 可開。","B":"對。官方：Services 只在 ITSM project 提供；Alerts、On-call 才是所有類型都能開。","C":"錯。即使 Jira admin 也只能替非 ITSM project 開 Alerts 與 On-call。","D":"錯。Services 是正式功能，不在 Feature lab。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-services-alerts-and-on-call-to-your-navigation-sidebar/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.2-e10","sec":"420.3.2","dom":"420.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A planned upgrade to the payment platform must be approved by the platform's team, and the website and mobile app teams want to know they may be affected. Which service settings support this? (Choose two.)","zh":"Payment platform 的升級必須由平台團隊核准，而且 website 與 mobile app 團隊想知道自己可能受影響。哪些 service 設定能支援？（選兩個）","zo":["在 payment platform 設 SLA","Payment platform service 的 change approvers","References：website 與 mobile app 依賴 payment platform","把 service type 設成「Critical」","把 website 團隊加成 customer"],"fig":"","opts":["An SLA on the payment platform","Change approvers on the payment platform service","References showing that the website and mobile app depend on the payment platform","Setting the service type to 'Critical'","Adding the website team as customers"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。SLA 衡量 request 處理時間，與核准、影響範圍無關。","B":"對。Change approvers 決定這個 service 的 change 要誰核准。","C":"對。References（Depends on）讓系統推算出依賴它的 website 與 mobile app，可加到 affected services。","D":"錯。Type 只是標籤，沒有技術影響。","E":"錯。Customer 是外部提單者，與 service 依賴無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-is-services/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/configure-services-settings-permissions-and-references/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.3-e11","sec":"420.3.3","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only customers who purchased 'Premium Support' should be able to submit the 'Priority support' request type. What should the admin do?","zh":"只有購買「Premium Support」的 customer 能提「Priority support」這個 request type。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["在 workflow 加檢查 email domain 的 validator","替付費客戶另開一個 service project","先建立 Premium Support 的 entitlement，再把 Entitlement 欄位加到 request type 並設為必填","每週手動把 request type 限制給一群 customer"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a validator to the workflow that checks the customer's email domain","Create a separate service project for premium customers","Add the Entitlement field to the request type and make it required, after creating Premium Support entitlements","Restrict the request type to a group of customers manually each week"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Email domain 不代表是否購買，而且有內建的 entitlement 機制。","B":"錯。開新 project 增加維護成本，沒有必要。","C":"對。官方：Entitlement 欄位設成必填時，沒有 entitlement 的 customer 沒有選項可選、無法送出表單。","D":"錯。手動維護名單容易出錯，而且 entitlement 正是為此設計的功能。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/about-products-and-entitlements/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/show-product-entitlement-details-on-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.3-e12","sec":"420.3.3","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An entitlement for 'Cloud Backup' is created for the organization 'Globex'. Who is associated with the entitlement?","zh":"替 organization「Globex」建立「Cloud Backup」的 entitlement。誰與這個 entitlement 關聯？","zo":["只有建立之後加入 Globex 的成員","只有 agent","只有提出需求的那位 customer","Globex organization 的所有 customer"],"fig":"","opts":["Only Globex members added after creation","Only agents","Only the customer who requested it","All customers in the Globex organization"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不分加入先後，成員都適用。","B":"錯。Entitlement 屬於 customer 端。","C":"錯。這是替 organization 建的，不是替個人。","D":"對。官方：對 organization 建 entitlement，組織內所有 customer 都與該 entitlement 關聯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-product-entitlements-for-your-customers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.3-e13","sec":"420.3.3","dom":"420.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create entitlement detail fields such as 'Support level' and 'Expiry date'?","zh":"誰能建立「Support level」「Expiry date」這類 entitlement detail fields？","zo":["Customer","只有 project admin","任何 agent","只有 Jira admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Customers","Project admins only","Any agent","Only Jira admins"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Customer 不能設定。","B":"錯。Project admin 權限不足，這是全站設定。","C":"錯。Agent 可以加、改 product，但不能建 entitlement detail fields。","D":"對。官方：必須是 Jira admin 才能建 entitlement detail fields（全站共用、最多 50 個）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-product-entitlements-for-your-customers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.3.3-e14","sec":"420.3.3","dom":"420.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Agents want to see a customer's support level directly on the work item view. What is required? (Choose two.)","zh":"Agent 想在 work item 畫面直接看到 customer 的 support level。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["把 customer 加成 request participant","建一個依 support level 篩選的 queue","給 agent Administer Jira 權限","替相關 entitlement detail field 開啟「Show on work item view」","把 Entitlement 欄位加到 request type"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the customer as a request participant","Create a queue filtered on support level","Grant agents the Administer Jira permission","Enable 'Show on work item view' for the relevant entitlement detail fields","Add the Entitlement field to the request types"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Participant 與顯示 entitlement 無關。","B":"錯。Queue 不會把資訊顯示在 work item 上。","C":"錯。Agent 不需要全站管理權限就能看到。","D":"對。要在 work item 顯示，需勾選 detail field 的 Show on work item view（Jira admin）。","E":"對。也要把 Entitlement 欄位加到 request type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/show-product-entitlement-details-on-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e01","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The request types 'Request new hardware' and 'Request new software' both use the Purchase issue type. What is true?","zh":"「Request new hardware」與「Request new software」兩個 request type 都使用 Purchase issue type。何者正確？","zo":["它們共用同一個 workflow，因為 workflow 來自 issue type","每個都可以再連到第二個 issue type","它們在 request form 上不能有不同的欄位","它們必須使用不同的 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["They share the same workflow because the workflow comes from the issue type","Each can be connected to a second issue type","They cannot have different fields on the request form","They must use different workflows"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Request type 管名稱、portal、表單欄位；workflow 與基礎欄位來自 issue type。","B":"錯。一個 request type 一次只能對應一個 issue type。","C":"錯。每個 request type 可以各自挑 request form 的欄位。","D":"錯。Workflow 由 issue type 決定，兩者 issue type 相同，workflow 就相同。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/whats-the-difference-between-request-types-and-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e02","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to temporarily stop showing the 'Office move' request type on the portal home page without deleting it. What should they do?","zh":"Project admin 想暫時不在 portal 首頁顯示「Office move」request type，但不刪除它。該怎麼做？","zo":["把它的 issue type 改成 Task","刪除 request type","把 request type 從所有 portal group 移除","把 request type 限制給 Administrators role"],"fig":"","opts":["Change its issue type to Task","Delete the request type","Remove the request type from all portal groups","Restrict the request type to the Administrators role"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。改 issue type 會影響 workflow 與欄位，不會隱藏它。","B":"錯。刪除會失去設定，題目要求保留。","C":"對。官方：把 request type 從所有 portal group 移除，就會在 portal 隱藏（仍可被搜尋與放進 help center topic）。","D":"錯。Restrictions 只能加 user、group、customer、organization（不能用 role），而且沒有權限的人連搜尋都找不到；這是限制誰能提單，不是暫時從首頁隱藏。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/organize-request-types-into-portal-groups/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e03","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"All 'Laptop request' tickets must be assigned to the procurement lead automatically, and customers must not see or change the assignee. What should be configured?","zh":"所有「Laptop request」工單都要自動指派給採購負責人，customer 不能看到或修改 assignee。應該設定什麼？","zo":["只把 Assignee 加到 issue view","把 project default assignee 設成採購負責人","讓 Assignee 在 portal 顯示並設為必填","把 Assignee 加到 request form，勾選「Use preset value and hide from portal」"],"fig":"","opts":["Add Assignee to the issue view only","Set the project default assignee to the procurement lead","Make Assignee visible and required on the portal","Add Assignee to the request form and select 'Use preset value and hide from portal'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只放 issue view 不會自動填值。","B":"錯。Default assignee 只能是 Unassigned 或 project lead，而且會影響所有 request type，不只 Laptop request。","C":"錯。官方：Assignee 不支援在 portal 顯示，而且 customer 不應該改它。","D":"對。勾 Use preset value and hide from portal 會自動填入並對 customer 隱藏；Assignee 這類 portal 不支援的欄位只能這樣用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/customize-the-fields-of-a-request-type/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-hidden-fields-and-unsupported-fields-in-request-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e04","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which fields can NOT be added to a request type at all? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些欄位完全不能加到 request type？（選兩個）","zo":["Request participants","Linked issues","Components","Security level","Assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["Request participants","Linked issues","Components","Security level","Assignee"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。Request participants 無法加到 request type 的表單。","B":"錯。Linked issues 可以加，但只能 preset 並隱藏。","C":"錯。Components 可以放在 request form。","D":"對。Security level 無法加到 request type。","E":"錯。Assignee 可以加，但只能用 preset value 隱藏。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-hidden-fields-and-unsupported-fields-in-request-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e05","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customers see the statuses 'In Progress' and 'Waiting for support' as separate steps, but the team wants customers to see one status called 'Being worked on'. What should the project admin do?","zh":"Customer 看到「In Progress」與「Waiting for support」是兩個步驟，團隊希望 customer 只看到一個「處理中」。Project admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["在 request type 的 workflow statuses，把兩個 status 的「Status name to show customer」設成相同","在 workflow 合併兩個 status","在 portal 隱藏 request type","在 Jira 全站設定改 status 名稱"],"fig":"","opts":["Under the request type's workflow statuses, set the same 'Status name to show customer' for both statuses","Merge the statuses in the workflow","Hide the request type from the portal","Rename the statuses globally in Jira settings"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Status name to show customer 可以把多個 status 對應成同一個顯示名稱，customer 也看不到它們之間的 transition。","B":"錯。合併 status 會改變 agent 的流程，題目只想改 customer 看到的樣子。","C":"錯。隱藏 request type 跟 status 顯示無關。","D":"錯。全站改名會影響所有 project 與 agent 看到的名稱，不只 customer。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/customize-the-workflow-statuses-for-a-request-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e06","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The 'Salary adjustment' request type should only be available to the HR managers group and the Finance customer organization. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"「Salary adjustment」request type 只能給 HR managers group 與 Finance customer organization 使用。哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Automation rule 不需額外設定就能使用它","在 request type 的 Restrictions 加入該 group 與 organization","Restrictions 也會讓其他 agent 看不到既有的薪資 request","若 email 管道使用這個 request type，限制後它對任何人都不會出現","Restrictions 可以加無限多的使用者與群組"],"fig":"","opts":["Automation rules can use it without any extra configuration","Add the group and organization under the request type's Restrictions","Restrictions also prevent other agents from viewing existing salary requests","If the request type is used by the email channel, it will no longer appear to anyone once restricted","Restrictions can include unlimited users and groups"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Automation 與 app user 預設沒有存取權，要另外加進名單。","B":"對。Restrictions 可加 user、group、customer account、organization。","C":"錯。Restrictions 只管誰能提單；要限制檢視請用 issue security。","D":"對。官方：email、chat、widget、virtual agent 使用的 request type 被限制後，對任何人都不再出現。","E":"錯。最多 50 個 user、group 或 organization。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-or-remove-restrictions-on-request-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e07","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A field is marked Required in the field configuration used by the 'IT help' issue type, but it is not on the request form and has no preset value. What happens when customers submit the request?","zh":"「IT help」issue type 使用的 field configuration 把某欄位設為必填，但它不在 request form 上、也沒有預設值。Customer 送出時會怎樣？","zo":["Request 照樣建立，欄位留空","Customer 無法建立 request，因為 field configuration 要求有值","Portal 上該欄位自動變成選填","通知 agent 補填該欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["The request is created and the field is left empty","Customers cannot create the request, because the field configuration requires a value","The field becomes optional on the portal automatically","Agents are notified to fill the field"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方 KB：欄位必填卻不在表單上、也沒有 preset，portal 會無法送出，不會留空建立。","B":"對。Field configuration 的必填是全面的；request form 上沒放又沒預設值，customer 就送不出。要只在 portal 必填，應在 request type 設 Required。","C":"錯。不會自動放寬。","D":"錯。沒有這種機制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/customize-the-fields-of-a-request-type/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/customers-unable-to-submit-tickets-due-to-required-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.1-e08","sec":"420.4.1","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create request types from the request type template library?","zh":"誰能從 request type template library 建立 request type？","zo":["任何 agent","Project admin","只有 Jira admin","Customer"],"fig":"","opts":["Any agent","Project admins","Jira admins only","Customers"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Agent 不能建立 request type。","B":"錯。Project admin 可以 Create blank，但 Create from template 只限 Jira admin。","C":"對。官方：Create from template（Jira admins only）。","D":"錯。Customer 不能建立 request type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-request-types-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e09","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A form should show the 'Hardware details' section only when the customer selects 'New device' in an earlier question. Which configuration achieves this?","zh":"表單中「Hardware details」section 只在 customer 前面選了「New device」時才顯示。用什麼設定？","zo":["每個答案各建一個 request type","用文字欄位搭配 automation 隱藏 section","在 workflow 加 validator","用 section 加條件邏輯，依 radio、checkbox 或 dropdown 欄位判斷"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a separate request type for each answer","Use a text field and automation to hide the section","Add a validator to the workflow","Use a section with conditional logic based on a radio, checkbox, or dropdown field"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。拆 request type 過度複雜，forms 本身就能處理。","B":"錯。條件只能依選項型欄位；automation 也不能即時藏表單 section。","C":"錯。Validator 在 transition 時檢查，不能控制表單內 section 的顯示。","D":"對。Section 的 Create logic 可以依 radio、checkbox、dropdown 欄位的答案 Show／Hide。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-or-edit-a-form/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e10","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The team wants to report on a form field's value with JQL and use it in automation. What should the project admin do?","zh":"團隊想用 JQL 查表單欄位的值並在 automation 使用。Project admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["送出後鎖定表單","什麼都不用做，form field 預設可被搜尋","把 form field 連到 Jira field","把表單匯出成 PDF"],"fig":"","opts":["Lock the form after submission","Nothing; form fields are searchable by default","Link the form field to a Jira field","Export the form as PDF"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。鎖定只影響能否再編輯。","B":"錯。Form field 只存在表單裡，不能直接用 JQL 搜尋。","C":"對。連到 Jira field 後，兩邊同步，JQL、automation、報表都能使用。","D":"錯。PDF 只是紀錄，不能查詢。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/link-a-form-field-to-a-jira-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e11","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"After a contract form is submitted, only project admins should be able to change it, and every resubmission should be recorded. Which preferences should be enabled? (Choose two.)","zh":"合約表單送出後，只有 project admin 能修改，並且每次重送都要留下紀錄。應開啟哪些 preferences？（選兩個）","zo":["把表單顯示為推薦","忽略所有欄位驗證","送出後鎖定，只有 admin 能編輯","每次重送時存一份 PDF","保持表單開放可編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["Show this form as recommended","Ignore all field validation","Lock this form once it's submitted so only admins can edit","Save a PDF version of this form each time it's resubmitted","Keep this form open for edits"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。推薦只影響 agent 加表單時的排序。","B":"錯。忽略驗證與需求無關，而且要先開 Keep open。","C":"對。鎖定後只有 admin 能編輯。","D":"對。每次重送存一份 PDF，可追蹤變更。","E":"錯。保持開放會讓任何人都能改，與需求相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/about-form-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e12","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A form is attached to the 'Access request' request type. A customer sends an access request by email instead of the portal. What happens to the form?","zh":"「Access request」request type 附了一張表單。Customer 改用 email 而不是 portal 提出申請。表單會怎樣？","zo":["表單會被 email 回給 customer","不會使用表單；email 管道不支援 forms","Email 內容會被解析進表單欄位","Request 被拒絕"],"fig":"","opts":["The form is emailed back to the customer","The form is not used; forms aren't supported in the email channel","The email body is parsed into the form fields","The request is rejected"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動寄表單。","B":"對。官方：forms 目前不能用在 email、chat、virtual agent、widget。","C":"錯。沒有把 email 內容解析進表單的機制。","D":"錯。Request 仍可依 email 設定建立，只是沒有表單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/where-can-my-form-appear/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e13","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about form fields and Jira fields are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 form field 與 Jira field，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["同一個 Jira field 可以同時在 request form 上並連到 form field","連結的欄位必須是相同類型","必填的 form field 可以放在條件 section","同一張表單裡，一個 Jira field 可連到兩個 form field","Project admin 可以建立 form field，不必建立全站 custom field"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira field can be on the request form and linked to a form field at the same time","Linked fields must be the same field type","A required form field can be placed in a conditional section","One Jira field can be linked to two form fields in the same form","Form fields can be created by project admins without creating site-wide custom fields"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。同一個 Jira field 不能同時在 request form 與表單上，否則會出現兩次。","B":"對。例如多選 form field 不能連到文字 Jira field。","C":"錯。必填欄位不能放在條件 section。","D":"錯。同一張表單裡，一個 Jira field 只能被連一次。","E":"對。Form field 直接在表單裡建，只存在表單，不需 Jira admin 建 custom field。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-forms/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/link-a-form-field-to-a-jira-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e14","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A French translation was added and completed for a form, but French-speaking customers still see English. What should be checked? (Choose two.)","zh":"表單已加入並完成法文翻譯，但說法文的 customer 仍看到英文。應檢查哪些？（選兩個）","zo":["Request type 是否在 portal group","法文翻譯的「Available to customers」開關","Portal 的 Language support 有沒有啟用法文","表單是否被鎖定","表單有沒有 shareable link"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the request type is in a portal group","The 'Available to customers' toggle for the French translation","Whether French is enabled in the portal's Language support","Whether the form is locked","Whether the form has a shareable link"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Customer 已經能看到表單（只是英文），所以不是 portal group 的問題。","B":"對。翻譯完成後要開 Available to customers 才會給 customer 看。","C":"對。官方：若出現警告，表示 portal 的 Language support 還沒啟用該語言。","D":"錯。鎖定與語言顯示無關。","E":"錯。Shareable link 與翻譯無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-translations-to-a-form/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e15","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The team wants to embed an intake form in a Confluence page so internal staff can create work items without opening the portal. What should be used?","zh":"團隊想把表單嵌在 Confluence 頁面，讓內部同仁不開 portal 就能建立 work item。該用什麼？","zo":["Queue","Attach to request types","在 form settings 建立 shareable link","Customer notification"],"fig":"","opts":["A queue","Attach to request types","Create a shareable link in the form settings","A customer notification"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Queue 是 agent 的工作清單。","B":"錯。Attach to request types 讓表單出現在 portal 的 request 表單中，不是不經 portal 建立。","C":"對。Shareable link 可直接用表單建 work item，也能貼到 Confluence 嵌入。","D":"錯。通知不能建立 work item。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/about-form-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.2-e16","sec":"420.4.2","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A form has been submitted and is locked. A customer needs to correct an answer. What can an admin do?","zh":"表單已送出並鎖定，customer 需要修正一個答案。Admin 能怎麼做？","zo":["關閉 Lock preference，既有表單就會自動解鎖","什麼都不能做，鎖定的表單永遠不能改","選「Open customer edits」讓 customer 在 portal 修改","刪掉 request 請 customer 重送"],"fig":"","opts":["Disable the Lock preference to unlock existing forms automatically","Nothing; locked forms can never change","Select 'Open customer edits' so the customer can change it in the portal","Delete the request and ask the customer to resubmit"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。改表單設定不會影響已經存在的表單實例。","B":"錯。Locked 只是限制只有 admin 能改。","C":"對。官方：admin 可以對 locked 表單 Edit，或選 Open customer edits 讓 customer 在 portal 修改。","D":"錯。刪 request 太粗暴而且失去紀錄。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-form-states/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e17","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After an admin added a required 'Department' field to the request type linked to support@company.atlassian.net, emails stopped creating requests. Why?","zh":"Admin 在連到 support@company.atlassian.net 的 request type 加了必填的「Department」欄位後，email 就不再建立 request。為什麼？","zo":["Department 欄位必須在 allowlist","Email requests 需要附表單","Email address 超過上限","給 email 用的 request type 只能讓 Summary 與 Description 必填"],"fig":"","opts":["The Department field must be in the allowlist","Email requests need a form attached","The email address exceeded its limit","A request type used for email can only have Summary and Description as required fields"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Allowlist 只放 domain。","B":"錯。Forms 不支援 email 管道。","C":"錯。題目沒有任何上限問題。","D":"對。官方：email 用的 request type 只能讓 Summary、Description 必填；多加必填欄位，該 email 的信就不會建立 work item。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/choose-suitable-request-type-for-connected-email-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e18","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A vendor's automated notifications (alerts@vendor.com) keep creating requests. Other emails from vendor.com must still be received. What should the project admin do?","zh":"廠商的自動通知信（alerts@vendor.com）一直建立 request。其他來自 vendor.com 的信仍要收。Project admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["把 alerts@vendor.com 加到 allowlist","停用所有 email requests","把 vendor.com 加到 blocklist","把 alerts@vendor.com 加到 blocklist"],"fig":"","opts":["Add alerts@vendor.com to the allowlist","Disable all email requests","Add vendor.com to the blocklist","Add alerts@vendor.com to the blocklist"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Allowlist 讓信永遠不被過濾，與需求相反，而且 allowlist 只支援 domain。","B":"錯。會停掉所有 email requests。","C":"錯。封鎖整個 domain 會擋掉其他需要的信。","D":"對。Blocklist 可以加單一 email address。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-your-blocklist/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e19","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"example.com is added to the allowlist. Which emails are guaranteed not to be filtered? (Choose two.)","zh":"example.com 加到 allowlist。哪些信保證不會被過濾？（選兩個）","zo":["user@example.com.au","billing@example.com，若通過 DMARC，且 example.com 與 billing@example.com 都不在 blocklist","user@example.com，即使 example.com 也在 blocklist","user@example.com，若通過 DMARC，且 domain 與該 email 都不在 blocklist","user@mail.example.com"],"fig":"","opts":["user@example.com.au","billing@example.com, if DMARC passes and neither example.com nor billing@example.com is on the blocklist","user@example.com, even if example.com is also on the blocklist","user@example.com, if it passes DMARC and neither the domain nor the address is on the blocklist","user@mail.example.com"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。不同的 domain。","B":"對。同 domain、domain 與這個 email 都不在 blocklist、DMARC 通過。","C":"錯。兩邊都有時 blocklist 優先。","D":"對。完全比對 example.com；DMARC 通過、又沒有被 blocklist（domain 或 email）擋下，就不會被過濾。","E":"錯。只做完全比對，子網域不算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-your-allowlist/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-edit-and-delete-domains-from-the-allowlist/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e20","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A service project needs separate addresses for HR, IT, and Facilities requests, each creating a different request type. What is true?","zh":"某 service project 需要 HR、IT、Facilities 三個獨立信箱，各自建立不同的 request type。何者正確？","zo":["所有 address 必須使用同一個 request type","不能使用外部 email address","每個 project 只能有一個 email address","最多可連 10 個 email address，各自連到自己的 request type"],"fig":"","opts":["All addresses must use the same request type","External addresses can't be used","Only one email address is allowed per project","Up to 10 email addresses can be connected, each linked to its own request type"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。可以各自不同。","B":"錯。可以加 Google、Microsoft 或其他 IMAP／POP 的外部 email。","C":"錯。不只一個。","D":"對。官方：一個 service project 最多 10 個 email address，每個指定自己的 request type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/connect-multiple-email-addresses-to-your-service-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e21","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The team changed the password of its connected Microsoft 365 mailbox, and new emails stopped becoming requests. What should be done?","zh":"團隊更改了已連接的 Microsoft 365 信箱密碼，之後新信不再變成 request。應該怎麼做？","zo":["重新連接外部 email 帳號","更換 request type","建立新的 service project","把 domain 加到 allowlist"],"fig":"","opts":["Reconnect the external email account","Change the request type","Create a new service project","Add the domain to the allowlist"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：外部 email 帳號改密碼後連線會中斷，需要重新連接。","B":"錯。Request type 不影響連線。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"錯。不是過濾問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/connect-multiple-email-addresses-to-your-service-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e22","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants to delete the request type currently used by the email channel. What must happen first?","zh":"Admin 想刪除目前被 email 管道使用的 request type。必須先做什麼？","zo":["停用該 service project 的所有 email requests","限制這個 request type","改 issue type","從所有 portal group 移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Disable all email requests for the service project","Restrict the request type","Change the issue type","Remove it from all portal groups"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：要刪 email 用的 request type，必須先關閉 email requests。","B":"錯。限制不是刪除的前提。","C":"錯。改 issue type 不是前提。","D":"錯。移出 portal group 只是隱藏。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/delete-request-types-from-your-service-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/disable-all-email-request-to-the-email-channel/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.3-e23","sec":"420.4.3","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Where can a project admin add a domain to the allowlist?","zh":"Project admin 在哪裡把 domain 加進 allowlist？","zo":["Jira settings > System > Outgoing mail","Atlassian Administration > Security","Space settings > Customer permissions","Space settings > Channels & self service > Email > More > Manage allowlist"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira settings > System > Outgoing mail","Atlassian Administration > Security","Space settings > Customer permissions","Space settings > Channels & self service > Email > More > Manage allowlist"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是寄出的郵件設定。","B":"錯。不在 Atlassian Administration。","C":"錯。Customer permissions 管 channel access 與 sharing。","D":"對。官方路徑：Channels & self service → Email → More → Manage allowlist。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-your-allowlist/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e24","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Purchase requests over $5,000 need approval from the finance manager, who has no JSM license. What is true?","zh":"超過 5,000 美元的採購 request 需要財務經理核准，他沒有 JSM 授權。何者正確？","zo":["經理以 service project customer 身分就能從 help center、email、Slack 或 Teams 核准","Approval 只對 Service Desk Team role 的 agent 有效","經理必須是 Jira admin","經理需要 agent 授權才能核准"],"fig":"","opts":["The manager can approve as a customer of the service project from the help center, email, Slack, or Teams","Approvals only work for agents in the Service Desk Team role","The manager must be a Jira admin","The manager needs an agent license to approve"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。只要是該 service project 的 customer 就能核准，管道包含 help center、email、Slack、Teams。","B":"錯。Approver 不限 agent。","C":"錯。不需要任何 admin 權限。","D":"錯。官方：approver 不需要 JSM 授權。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-approvals/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e25","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin tries to add an approval step to the 'Waiting for approval' status, but the 'Include approval step' option is unavailable. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Jira admin 想在「Waiting for approval」status 加 approval step，但「Include approval step」選項無法使用。最可能的原因？","zo":["Approver 欄位是 user picker","Request type 在 portal group 裡","Project 使用了 SLA","該 status 沒有至少兩個 Approve 與 Decline 的 transition"],"fig":"","opts":["The approver field is a user picker","The request type is in a portal group","The project uses SLAs","The status does not have at least two outgoing transitions for Approve and Decline"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Approver 欄位本來就應該是 user picker（multiple users）或 group picker。","B":"錯。Portal group 與 workflow 無關。","C":"錯。SLA 不影響 approval 設定。","D":"對。官方：status 至少要有兩個 transition（Approve 與 Decline）才能勾 Include approval step。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-an-approval-to-a-workflow/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e26","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"All 'Access to payroll system' requests must be approved by the Payroll Admins group, and customers must not choose approvers. What should be configured?","zh":"所有「Access to payroll system」request 都要由 Payroll Admins group 核准，customer 不能自己選 approver。應該設定什麼？","zo":["建 automation rule 留言 @Payroll Admins","把 Approvers 欄位加到 request form 並設為必填","把 group picker 的 approver 欄位加到 request form，勾「Use preset value and hide from portal」並填 Payroll Admins","請 customer 把該 group 加成 request participants"],"fig":"","opts":["Create an automation rule that comments @Payroll Admins","Add the Approvers field to the request form and make it required","Add a group picker approver field to the request form with 'Use preset value and hide from portal' set to Payroll Admins","Ask customers to add the group as request participants"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。留言提及不會建立核准步驟。","B":"錯。這樣 customer 會自己選 approver，與需求相反；而且 customer 不能選 group。","C":"對。Preset value 並隱藏，就是預設 approver 清單；group picker 可以放 group。","D":"錯。Participant 不是 approver。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-a-pre-set-list-of-approvers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e27","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customers should pick their own manager as approver when raising leave requests, but the Approvers field shows no results when they search. What must be configured?","zh":"Customer 提請假 request 時要自己選主管當 approver，但 Approvers 欄位搜尋不到任何人。必須設定什麼？","zo":["每位 customer 一個 JSM 授權","Customer sharing 設為「Customers can search for other customers within their space or organizations」","Channel access 設為 Restricted","把 Approvers 欄位設為隱藏"],"fig":"","opts":["A JSM license for each customer","Customer sharing set to 'Customers can search for other customers within their space or organizations'","Channel access set to Restricted","The Approvers field set to hidden"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Customer 不需要授權。","B":"對。官方：讓 customer 選 approver 前，customer permissions 的 sharing 要選這個選項。","C":"錯。Restricted 只控制誰能提單。","D":"錯。隱藏欄位 customer 就選不了。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/allow-customers-to-choose-approvers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e28","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which settings are configured when adding an approval step to a workflow status? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 workflow status 加 approval step 時，會設定哪些項目？（選兩個）","zo":["Request type 的 portal group","Customer notification template","需要幾位 approver","排除哪些欄位的使用者核准（例如 Reporter）","SLA calendar"],"fig":"","opts":["The portal group of the request type","The customer notification template","The number of approvers required","The fields whose users are excluded from approving, such as Reporter","The SLA calendar"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Portal group 是 request type 的設定。","B":"錯。通知 template 不在 approval step 設定。","C":"對。Number of approvers 決定需要幾人核准。","D":"對。Exclude approvers from 可以排除某些欄位的人（例如 reporter）核准。","E":"錯。Calendar 是 SLA 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-an-approval-to-a-workflow/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e29","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"What are benefits of adding approval steps with transitions visible in the customer portal? (Choose two.)","zh":"加入 approval step 並讓 transition 在 customer portal 可見，有哪些好處？（選兩個）","zo":["Approver 必須以 agent 身分登入 Jira","加了 approval 後 SLA 會永久停止","Approval 讓 workflow 變得不需要","Customer 在 portal 看得到 request 正在等待核准","核准或拒絕後 request 自動轉換"],"fig":"","opts":["Approvers must log into Jira as agents","SLAs stop permanently once an approval is added","Approvals remove the need for a workflow","Customers can see in the portal that their request is waiting for approval","The request automatically transitions after an approve or decline decision"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Approver 不需要 agent 授權或登入 Jira。","B":"錯。Approval 不會讓 SLA 永久停止。","C":"錯。Approval 是掛在 workflow 的 status 上。","D":"對。Portal 顯示等待核准的狀態，customer 不必來回追問。","E":"對。核准或拒絕後自動走對應的 transition。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-approvals/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.4.4-e30","sec":"420.4.4","dom":"420.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"For a change request, approvers should automatically be the change approvers of the services listed on the request. Which configuration supports this?","zh":"Change request 的 approver 要自動成為 request 上所列 service 的 change approvers。哪個設定能支援？","zo":["Approver source 設為 Affected services，並在每個 service 定義 change approvers","讓 customer 手動選 approver","Approvers 預設值設成 CAB group","把 request participants 設成 service owners"],"fig":"","opts":["Approver source set to Affected services, with change approvers defined on each service","Customers choosing approvers manually","A preset Approvers value of the CAB group","Request participants set to the service owners"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：approver source 可以來自 affected services，需先在 service 設 change approvers、在 request type 加 Affected services 欄位。","B":"錯。題目要求自動依 service 決定。","C":"錯。固定 CAB group 不會依 service 不同而變。","D":"錯。Participant 不是 approver。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-an-approval-to-a-workflow/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.1-e01","sec":"420.5.1","dom":"420.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"During a major outage, the IT team wants every customer visiting the IT portal to see a notice before raising a request. Agents, not only admins, must be able to post it. What should the project admin do? (Choose two.)","zh":"大規模中斷期間，IT 團隊希望每位進入 IT portal 的 customer 在提單前都看到通知，而且 agent（不只 admin）也要能發布。Project admin 應該怎麼做？（選兩個）","zo":["對所有 customer 寄 customer notification","加 external resource 連結","更換 portal logo","在 portal 加 announcement","勾選「Yes, agents can add announcements to this portal」"],"fig":"","opts":["Send a customer notification to all customers","Add an external resource link","Change the portal logo","Add an announcement to the portal","Select 'Yes, agents can add announcements to this portal'"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Customer notification 是針對某張 request 的事件，不能群發給所有 customer。","B":"錯。External resource 是相關資源連結，不是公告。","C":"錯。Logo 與公告無關。","D":"對。Portal 公告會顯示在 portal 頂端，提單前就看得到。","E":"對。Project admin 在 Portal 設定勾這個選項，agent 才能自己發公告。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-an-announcement-to-the-portal/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.1-e02","sec":"420.5.1","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to change the banner color and button color of the IT portal. Where is this done?","zh":"Project admin 想更改 IT portal 的 banner 與按鈕顏色。要在哪裡設定？","zo":["在 portal 所屬的 help center","Space settings > Details > Avatar","Jira settings > Look and feel","Space settings > Channels & self service > Portal"],"fig":"","opts":["In the help center the portal belongs to","Space settings > Details > Avatar","Jira settings > Look and feel","Space settings > Channels & self service > Portal"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：portal 的 URL、banner、按鈕與連結顏色繼承自所屬 help center，要在 help center 修改。","B":"錯。Avatar 是 project 在 Jira 內的圖示。","C":"錯。Jira 的 look and feel 不影響 help center。","D":"錯。Portal 設定頁只有名稱、介紹與 logo。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/brand-your-portal/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.1-e03","sec":"420.5.1","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"HR wants the portal to link to a VPN setup video and the company leave policy hosted outside Jira. What should be configured, and what is the limit?","zh":"HR 想在 portal 連到放在 Jira 外部的 VPN 設定影片與請假政策。應該設定什麼？上限是多少？","zo":["External resources；最多 10 個，顯示為 Related resources","Portal groups；最多 3 個","Canned responses；無限制","Announcements；最多 5 個"],"fig":"","opts":["External resources; up to 10 links shown as Related resources","Portal groups; up to 3","Canned responses; unlimited","Announcements; up to 5"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。External resources 最多 10 個連結，在 portal 顯示為 Related resources。","B":"錯。Portal groups 分組 request type。","C":"錯。Canned responses 給 agent 回覆用。","D":"錯。公告是訊息，不是資源清單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/add-links-to-external-resources-in-your-portal/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.1-e04","sec":"420.5.1","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Most customers of a service project are in Japan, but the site language is English. Customers whose preferred language isn't supported currently see English. What should the project admin do?","zh":"某 service project 的 customer 多在日本，但站台語言是英文。偏好語言不被支援的 customer 目前看到英文。Project admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["請 Jira admin 改站台語言","另開 project 手動翻譯每個 request type","只把 portal 名稱加上日文","在 Language support 把 service project 的預設語言改成日文"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask the Jira admin to change the site language","Translate every request type manually into a new project","Add Japanese to the portal name only","Change the service project's default language to Japanese in Language support"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。改全站語言影響所有使用者，不必要。","B":"錯。不需要另開 project。","C":"錯。只改名稱不會讓整個 portal 變日文。","D":"對。官方建議 default language 與多數 customer 一致；customer 的偏好語言未加入或被停用時就看到預設語言。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/change-your-service-projects-default-language/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.1-e05","sec":"420.5.1","dom":"420.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which items can be translated through a service project's language support? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些項目能透過 service project 的 language support 翻譯？（選兩個）","zo":["Request types","Customer notifications 與 email templates","Workflow validators","Permission scheme 名稱","SLA calendars"],"fig":"","opts":["Request types","Customer notifications and email templates","Workflow validators","Permission scheme names","SLA calendars"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Request type 可以翻譯。","B":"對。Customer notifications 與 email templates 可以翻譯。","C":"錯。Workflow 設定不在語言支援範圍。","D":"錯。Permission scheme 不是 customer 看到的內容。","E":"錯。SLA calendar 不翻譯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-is-language-support/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.1-e06","sec":"420.5.1","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin selects a widget default request type and sees an error that the request type isn't valid. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Project admin 選 widget 的 default request type 時，看到 request type 無效的錯誤。最可能的原因？","zo":["Portal 是公開的","Request type 在 portal group 裡","連結了知識庫","Request type 有 widget 無法顯示的必填欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["The portal is open","The request type is in a portal group","The knowledge base is linked","The request type has a required field that can't be rendered in the widget"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Widget 反而需要 open portal。","B":"錯。在 portal group 中不影響 widget。","C":"錯。連結 KB 不會造成 request type 無效。","D":"對。官方：出現無效錯誤代表該 request type 有 widget 無法顯示的必填欄位，把它改成選填即可。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/embed-a-widget-onto-a-web-page/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.2-e07","sec":"420.5.2","dom":"420.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The virtual agent sometimes fails to create work items, and customers receive a broken link. The default request type is hidden from the portal and has a required 'Cost center' field. What should be fixed? (Choose two.)","zh":"Virtual agent 有時建不了 work item，customer 收到失效連結。Default request type 被藏在 portal 外，且有必填的「Cost center」欄位。應修正哪些？（選兩個）","zo":["加更多 training phrases","停用 AI answers","讓 default request type 在 portal 可見","移除 default request type 的必填欄位","關閉 Greet standard flow"],"fig":"","opts":["Add more training phrases","Disable AI answers","Make the default request type visible in the portal","Remove required fields from the default request type","Turn off the Greet standard flow"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。訓練句影響 intent 比對，不影響建立 work item。","B":"錯。AI answers 與建立失敗無關。","C":"對。官方：default request type 不能從 portal 隱藏，建立失敗時 virtual agent 會給 customer 該表單的連結。","D":"對。Default request type 不能有必填欄位，virtual agent 無法填寫。","E":"錯。Greet 與建立 work item 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-or-change-the-virtual-agent-default-request-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.2-e08","sec":"420.5.2","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customers often ask how to reset passwords for various applications. The team wants a guided, step-by-step conversation that asks which application, sends the right link, and raises a request if it doesn't help. What should be configured?","zh":"Customer 常問各種應用程式的密碼重設方法。團隊想要一步步引導：先問哪個應用程式、給對的連結、沒幫到就建 request。應該設定什麼？","zo":["Canned response","Portal 公告","有 conversation flow 的 intent","只用 AI answers"],"fig":"","opts":["A canned response","A portal announcement","An intent with a conversation flow","AI answers only"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Canned response 給 agent 回覆用。","B":"錯。公告無法互動。","C":"對。Intent 代表特定問題，conversation flow 可以一步步問問題、給連結、再視情況建 request；官方範例正是 Password reset。","D":"錯。AI answers 只會摘要文章，不能保證照固定步驟走。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-edit-or-delete-an-intent/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.2-e09","sec":"420.5.2","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What happens when a customer stops responding to the virtual agent for five minutes?","zh":"Customer 對 virtual agent 五分鐘沒有回應時會發生什麼？","zo":["對話被刪除","Auto-close standard flow 詢問是否還需要幫忙","立即建立 work item","Greet flow 重新開始"],"fig":"","opts":["The conversation is deleted","The Auto-close standard flow asks if they still need help","A work item is created immediately","The Greet flow restarts"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會刪除。","B":"對。官方：5 分鐘沒有動作就啟動 auto-close，詢問是否還需要幫忙。","C":"錯。不會自動建 work item。","D":"錯。Greet 只在第一句話時。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/about-standard-flows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.2-e10","sec":"420.5.2","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On the Conversations page, many conversations are 'AI answered' but also 'Escalated' with low CSAT scores. What is the most likely improvement?","zh":"在 Conversations 頁，許多對話是「AI answered」但同時「Escalated」，CSAT 也偏低。最可能的改善方向？","zo":["刪除所有 intent","關閉 Resolve standard flow","把 default request type 改成有必填欄位的","更新連結的知識庫文章，它們可能過時或不完整"],"fig":"","opts":["Delete all intents","Turn off the Resolve standard flow","Change the default request type to one with required fields","Update the linked knowledge base articles, which are likely outdated or incomplete"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。題目問題出在 AI answers，不是 intent。","B":"錯。關掉 Resolve 會讓 customer 無法表示已解決。","C":"錯。必填欄位會讓 virtual agent 建不了 work item。","D":"對。官方：AI 回答後仍 escalate 或 CSAT 低，常代表知識庫過時或資訊不足。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/use-conversation-data-to-improve-your-virtual-agents-performance/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.2-e11","sec":"420.5.2","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The team wants to stop the virtual agent from sending its greeting message. What should they do?","zh":"團隊想讓 virtual agent 不再發送打招呼訊息。應該怎麼做？","zo":["停用所有 intent","關閉 virtual agent","把 Greet standard flow 的 Message 欄位留空","刪除 default request type"],"fig":"","opts":["Disable all intents","Turn off the virtual agent","Leave the Message field of the Greet standard flow blank","Delete the default request type"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。停用 intent 不會影響 greeting。","B":"錯。不必關掉整個 virtual agent。","C":"對。官方：Greet 是選用的，把 Message 欄位留空就會關閉。","D":"錯。與 greeting 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/about-standard-flows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.2-e12","sec":"420.5.2","dom":"420.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about intents are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 intent，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Intent 的 conversation flow 不能建立 work item","每個 intent 都需要 training phrases 讓 virtual agent 辨識","Display name 可能以選項形式顯示給 customer 開始 flow","Intent 可以在 email 管道使用","只有 Jira admin 能建立 intent"],"fig":"","opts":["An intent's conversation flow can't create work items","Each intent needs training phrases so the virtual agent can recognize it","The display name may be shown to customers as an option to start the flow","Intents work in the email channel","Only Jira admins can create intents"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Flow 可以建 work item，也能用 Change request type and fields 步驟換 request type。","B":"對。建立 intent 時要填 3 個 training phrases。","C":"對。Display name 可能以選項形式讓 customer 點選。","D":"錯。官方：intent 在 email 以外的 customer 管道都能用。","E":"錯。Project（space）admin 就能建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-edit-or-delete-an-intent/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.3-e13","sec":"420.5.3","dom":"420.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A customer turned off notifications for their request in the portal. Which notifications will they still receive? (Choose two.)","zh":"Customer 在 portal 關閉了某張 request 的通知。他仍會收到哪些通知？（選兩個）","zo":["Internal notes","Request 被解決時","身為 approver 需要他核准時","每一則公開留言","Request 被重新指派時"],"fig":"","opts":["Internal notes","When the request is resolved","When their approval is required as an approver","Every public comment","When the request is reassigned"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Internal note 永遠不會寄給 customer。","B":"對。官方：即使關閉，request 解決時仍會收到通知。","C":"對。被加為 approver 且需要核准時仍會收到。","D":"錯。關閉後不會收到一般留言通知。","E":"錯。指派變更不會通知 customer。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-notifications-do-my-customers-and-service-desk-team-receive/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.3-e14","sec":"420.5.3","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An agent created a request on behalf of a customer (so the agent is the Reporter) and then is assigned the request. Which notifications does the agent receive?","zh":"Agent 代 customer 建立 request（所以 agent 是 Reporter），之後又被指派這張 request。Agent 會收到哪種通知？","zo":["只有 customer notifications","只有 internal notifications，因為 internal 優先","每個事件兩種都收","完全沒有通知"],"fig":"","opts":["Customer notifications only","Internal notifications only, because internal notifications take priority","Both types for every event","No notifications"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。只有 reporter 身分時才只收 customer notifications。","B":"對。官方：同時是 customer 與 agent 時 internal 優先；取消指派後才回到 customer notifications。","C":"錯。不會兩種都收。","D":"錯。仍會收到 internal。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-notifications-do-my-customers-and-service-desk-team-receive/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.3-e15","sec":"420.5.3","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a customer adds a public comment, the team wants other customers on the request notified, but not the customer who commented. How should the 'Public comment added' customer notification be configured?","zh":"Customer 加公開留言時，團隊希望通知該 request 的其他 customer，但不通知留言者本人。「Public comment added」customer notification 應如何設定？","zo":["停用規則，改用 internal notifications","收件人：Approvers","收件人：Customers involved，並勾「Exclude person who caused the action」","收件人：只有 Reporter (customer)"],"fig":"","opts":["Disable the rule and use internal notifications","Recipients: Approvers","Recipients: Customers involved, with 'Exclude person who caused the action'","Recipients: Reporter (customer) only"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Internal notifications 不會寄給 customer。","B":"錯。Approvers 不是這個需求的收件人。","C":"對。Customers involved 包含 reporter 與 participants，再排除觸發者本人。","D":"錯。只寄 reporter 會漏掉 participants，且若留言者就是 reporter 會寄給他自己。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/edit-the-content-of-your-customer-notifications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.3-e16","sec":"420.5.3","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Where are notifications for agents watching a service request configured?","zh":"Agent watch 某 service request 時收到的通知，是在哪裡設定的？","zo":["Canned responses","Portal 設定","Space settings > Notifications > Customer notifications","Service project 使用的 Jira notification scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Canned responses","The portal settings","Space settings > Notifications > Customer notifications","The Jira notification scheme used by the service project"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Canned response 是回覆範本。","B":"錯。Portal 設定與 agent 通知無關。","C":"錯。Customer notifications 頁只管給 customer 的通知。","D":"對。官方：internal notifications 由 Jira 寄出，依 service project 的 notification scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-notifications-do-my-customers-and-service-desk-team-receive/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.3-e17","sec":"420.5.3","dom":"420.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants a reply template, 'Password reset instructions', available to all agents in the project. What should be done?","zh":"Project admin 想讓「密碼重設說明」回覆範本給 project 內所有 agent 使用。應該怎麼做？","zo":["Agent 建 personal，之後改成 Shared","加成 customer notification","每位 agent 各自建 personal canned response","Project admin 建立 Shared 的 canned response"],"fig":"","opts":["An agent creates a personal response and later changes it to Shared","Add it as a customer notification","Each agent creates a personal canned response","The project admin creates a canned response with Shared availability"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Agent 只能建 personal，而且 availability 建立後不能改。","B":"錯。Customer notification 是事件通知，不是回覆範本。","C":"錯。每人各建一份難以維持一致。","D":"對。Shared 可讓整個 project 的 agent 使用，而且只有 project admin 能設 availability。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-a-canned-response/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.5.3-e18","sec":"420.5.3","dom":"420.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements distinguish customer notifications from internal notifications? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些敘述能分辨 customer notifications 與 internal notifications？（選兩個）","zo":["Internal notifications 永遠不會寄給 customer","Customer notifications 由 project admin 在 service project 逐事件設定","Customer notifications 由 Jira notification scheme 控制","Internal notifications 可在 Customer notifications 頁用 ${recipient.name} 變數編輯","Customer 當 watcher 時會收到 internal notifications"],"fig":"","opts":["Internal notifications are never sent to customers","Customer notifications are configured by project admins per event in the service project","Customer notifications are controlled by the Jira notification scheme","Internal notifications can be edited with ${recipient.name} variables on the Customer notifications page","Customers receive internal notifications when they are watchers"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。官方：internal 只寄給 agent 與 admin。","B":"對。Customer notifications 在 Space settings → Notifications → Customer notifications，由 project admin 逐規則設定。","C":"錯。那是 internal notifications。","D":"錯。Customer notifications 頁的變數只用在 customer 通知。","E":"錯。Customer 不會收到 internal notifications。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-notifications-do-my-customers-and-service-desk-team-receive/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/edit-the-content-of-your-customer-notifications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.1-e01","sec":"420.6.1","dom":"420.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A project admin wants public help articles to be readable by anyone on the internet without logging in, but 'Anyone' is not available in the Who can view dropdown. What could cause this? (Choose two.)","zh":"Project admin 想讓公開文章不用登入、網路上任何人都能讀，但 Who can view 下拉選單沒有「Anyone」。可能原因？（選兩個）","zo":["知識庫使用 Confluence Free 方案","Space 的頁面太多","文章有 label","Agent 不在 Service Desk Team role","Jira admin 沒在 site 層開 Knowledge base permissions 的「Anyone」"],"fig":"","opts":["The knowledge base is powered by a Free Confluence plan","The space has too many pages","The articles have labels","Agents lack the Service Desk Team role","The site-level knowledge base permission 'Anyone' is not turned on by the Jira admin"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Anyone 只在 KB 由付費 Confluence（Standard 以上）支援的站台出現。","B":"錯。頁數不影響權限選項。","C":"錯。Label 與權限無關。","D":"錯。Agent 的 role 不影響這個選項。","E":"對。官方：site 層要開 Anyone，project admin 才能選。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-knowledge-base-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-knowledge-base-permissions-from-your-service-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.1-e02","sec":"420.6.1","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin unlinks a Confluence space from the service project's knowledge base. What happens?","zh":"Project admin 把某 Confluence space 從 service project 的知識庫取消連結。會發生什麼？","zo":["Space 從 service project 移除，但仍在 Confluence 中","所有文章被封存","Customer 仍會在 portal 看到這些文章","Confluence space 被刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["The space is removed from the service project but remains available in Confluence","All articles are archived","Customers keep seeing the articles in the portal","The Confluence space is deleted"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。只從 service project 移除，space 仍在 Confluence。","B":"錯。不會封存文章。","C":"錯。取消連結後，portal 不再從該 space 取文章。","D":"錯。官方：unlink 不會刪 Confluence 內容。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/unlink-confluence-spaces-from-your-service-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.1-e03","sec":"420.6.1","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Agents should be able to create and edit knowledge base articles directly from Jira Service Management. Which setting is needed?","zh":"Agent 應能直接在 JSM 建立與編輯知識庫文章。需要哪個設定？","zo":["開啟 article suggestions","Who can edit：Service space users","Who can view：Anyone","Who can edit：Only Confluence users"],"fig":"","opts":["Article suggestions enabled","Who can edit: Service space users","Who can view: Anyone","Who can edit: Only Confluence users"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Suggestions 是推薦給 customer。","B":"對。Service space users 讓 agent 與 admin 在 JSM 建立、編輯文章。","C":"錯。這是檢視權限。","D":"錯。只有有 Confluence 授權的人能編輯，agent 若沒有 Confluence 授權就不行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/manage-knowledge-base-permissions-from-your-service-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.1-e04","sec":"420.6.1","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An IT team wants detailed VPN provisioning runbooks visible only to agents, while general VPN troubleshooting steps should be available to customers in the portal. How should the knowledge base be set up?","zh":"IT 團隊希望 VPN 開通的詳細 runbook 只有 agent 看得到，一般的 VPN 排錯步驟則讓 customer 在 portal 看。知識庫該怎麼設定？","zo":["Runbook 用 internal knowledge base，給 customer 的步驟用 external knowledge base","全部放同一個 space，Who can view 設為 Anyone","把 runbook 存成 canned responses","只用 article suggestions 搭配 label"],"fig":"","opts":["Use an internal knowledge base for runbooks and an external knowledge base for customer-facing steps","Put everything in one space with Who can view: Anyone","Store runbooks as canned responses","Use article suggestions with labels only"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方範例：internal KB 放只給 agent 的敏感內容，external KB 給 customer 自助。","B":"錯。Anyone 會讓 runbook 對全網公開。","C":"錯。Canned response 是回覆範本，不是知識庫。","D":"錯。Label 只影響推薦，不會限制誰能看。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/the-difference-between-internal-and-external-knowledge-bases/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.2-e05","sec":"420.6.2","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customers raising 'VPN access' requests see irrelevant printer articles as suggestions. What should the project admin configure?","zh":"提出「VPN access」request 的 customer 看到不相關的印表機文章推薦。Project admin 應該設定什麼？","zo":["替該 request form 設定「Only show articles labeled」為 VPN 的 label，並替 VPN 文章加上 label","把 Who can view 改成 Only Confluence users","只保留一個 space，其他都取消連結","關閉知識庫"],"fig":"","opts":["Set 'Only show articles labeled' to a VPN label for that request form and label the VPN articles","Change Who can view to Only Confluence users","Unlink all spaces except one","Turn off the knowledge base"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：用 labels 限制推薦的文章，建議用與 request form 相近的 label。","B":"錯。這會讓 customer 看不到任何文章。","C":"錯。過度且影響其他 request type。","D":"錯。關掉 KB 會失去自助功能。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-article-suggestions-in-request-forms/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.2-e06","sec":"420.6.2","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When do suggested articles appear to customers raising a request in the portal?","zh":"Customer 在 portal 提單時，建議文章什麼時候出現？","zo":["Customer 在 Summary 欄位打字時","只出現在 email 通知","只在 issue view 給 agent 看","送出 request 之後"],"fig":"","opts":["While the customer is typing in the Summary field","Only in email notifications","Only to agents in the issue view","After the request is submitted"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：customer 在 Summary 欄位打字時就會出現建議文章。","B":"錯。不是透過通知信。","C":"錯。Article suggestions 是給 customer 的。","D":"錯。是提單過程中，不是送出後。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-article-suggestions-in-request-forms/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.2-e07","sec":"420.6.2","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Article suggestions are enabled for a request form, but no suggestions appear in the portal. The knowledge base is linked to a space on a different Confluence site. What is the reason?","zh":"某 request form 已開啟 article suggestions，但 portal 沒有出現任何建議。知識庫連結的是另一個 Confluence site 的 space。原因？","zo":["建議只對未登入的使用者有效","每篇文章都必須有 label","知識庫連到其他 Confluence site 的 space 時，portal 不會顯示 article suggestions","Request type 在 portal group 中"],"fig":"","opts":["Suggestions only work for logged-out users","Suggestions require a label on every article","Article suggestions don't show in the portal when the knowledge base is linked to spaces on a different Confluence site","The request type is in a portal group"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。沒有這種限制。","B":"錯。Label 是選用的限縮條件。","C":"對。官方明列此限制。","D":"錯。Portal group 不影響建議。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-article-suggestions-in-request-forms/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.6.2-e08","sec":"420.6.2","dom":"420.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How are article suggestions enabled?","zh":"Article suggestions 是如何開啟的？","zo":["依 customer organization 開","依 queue 開","由 Jira admin 對整個站台開一次","在 knowledge base 設定中，逐一對 request form 開「Allow suggestions?」"],"fig":"","opts":["Per customer organization","Per queue","Once for the whole site by a Jira admin","Per request form, using the 'Allow suggestions?' toggle in the knowledge base settings"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。與 organization 無關。","B":"錯。Queue 是 agent 的清單。","C":"錯。不是全站一個開關。","D":"對。官方：Control article suggestions 下，對每個 request form 開 Allow suggestions?。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/set-up-article-suggestions-in-request-forms/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.1-e01","sec":"420.7.1","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager wants a filter of requests where the most recent 'Time to resolution' SLA cycle missed its goal. Which JQL fits?","zh":"主管要一個 filter：最近一個「Time to resolution」SLA cycle 沒達標的 request。哪段 JQL 適合？","zo":["\"Time to resolution\" = everBreached()","\"Time to resolution\" = breached()","\"Time to resolution\" = paused()","\"Time to resolution\" = completed()"],"fig":"","opts":["\"Time to resolution\" = everBreached()","\"Time to resolution\" = breached()","\"Time to resolution\" = paused()","\"Time to resolution\" = completed()"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。everBreached() 只要曾經違約就算，不限最近一個 cycle。","B":"對。breached() 回傳最近一個 SLA cycle 未達標的 work item。","C":"錯。paused() 找暫停中的。","D":"錯。completed() 找 cycle 已完成的，不分是否達標。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.1-e02","sec":"420.7.1","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL returns requests still waiting for Mia to approve or decline?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出還在等 Mia 核准或拒絕的 request？","zo":["approvals = approver(mia)","approvals = pendingApprovalBy(mia)","approvals = approved()","approvals = pendingBy(mia)"],"fig":"","opts":["approvals = approver(mia)","approvals = pendingApprovalBy(mia)","approvals = approved()","approvals = pendingBy(mia)"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。approver() 不論 Mia 是否已決定都會回傳，也包含已完成的 step。","B":"對。官方：pendingApprovalBy() 找 Mia 是進行中 step 的 approver，且還沒核准或拒絕。","C":"錯。approved() 找最終已核准的。","D":"錯。官方：pendingBy() 的 Mia「may or may not have already approved or declined」，可能已經按過。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.1-e03","sec":"420.7.1","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL finds work items related to entitlements for the product 'Acme Widget'?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出與「Acme Widget」product entitlement 相關的 work item？","zo":["organizations in organizationDetail(\"Product\", \"Acme Widget\")","entitlement in entitlementProduct(\"Acme Widget\")","product = \"Acme Widget\"","entitlement = \"Acme Widget\""],"fig":"","opts":["organizations in organizationDetail(\"Product\", \"Acme Widget\")","entitlement in entitlementProduct(\"Acme Widget\")","product = \"Acme Widget\"","entitlement = \"Acme Widget\""],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。organizationDetail 查 organization 的 detail field，不是 entitlement 的 product。","B":"對。官方語法：entitlement in entitlementProduct(\"Product Name\")。","C":"錯。沒有 product 這個欄位用法。","D":"錯。Entitlement 欄位要搭配函數查 product。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.1-e04","sec":"420.7.1","dom":"420.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which JQL statements use JSM-specific functions correctly? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些 JQL 正確使用了 JSM 專屬函數？（選兩個）","zo":["approvals = pending()","organizations = organizationMembers(\"Acme\")","sla = breached()","approvals ~ approved()","reporter in organizationMembers(\"Acme\")"],"fig":"","opts":["approvals = pending()","organizations = organizationMembers(\"Acme\")","sla = breached()","approvals ~ approved()","reporter in organizationMembers(\"Acme\")"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。pending() 找還在等核准的 request。","B":"錯。organizationMembers 回傳的是使用者，要用 IN 搭配使用者欄位。","C":"錯。SLA 函數要搭配具體 SLA 欄位名稱，例如 \"Time to resolution\"。","D":"錯。approved() 只支援 = 與 !=。","E":"對。organizationMembers() 回傳該 organization 成員，用在 reporter 等使用者欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.1-e05","sec":"420.7.1","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead shares a saved filter of VIP requests with the 'Sales' group. A Sales member opens it but sees fewer results than the team lead. Why?","zh":"團隊主管把 VIP request 的 filter 分享給「Sales」group。某位 Sales 成員打開後看到的結果比主管少。為什麼？","zo":["JQL 函數在分享的 filter 中無效","分享的 filter 只顯示前 50 筆","使用者只看得到自己有權限瀏覽的 work item","每位使用者都要重新儲存 filter"],"fig":"","opts":["JQL functions don't work in shared filters","Shared filters only show the first 50 results","Users only see work items they have permission to browse","The filter must be re-saved by each user"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。函數在分享的 filter 中照常運作。","B":"錯。沒有這種限制。","C":"對。分享 filter 不會給看 work item 的權限；每人只看得到自己有 Browse 權限（與 issue security 允許）的結果。","D":"錯。分享後即可使用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.2-e06","sec":"420.7.2","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to add a series to the default 'Workload' report. What happens?","zh":"Project admin 想在預設的「Workload」報表加 series。會怎樣？","zo":["Series 只能加到 dashboard","跟一般報表一樣可以加","Default reports 不能改；要改建 custom report","只有 Jira admin 能改 default reports"],"fig":"","opts":["Series can only be added to dashboards","It works like any report","Default reports can't be changed; create a custom report instead","Only Jira admins can edit default reports"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Series 是加在 custom report。","B":"錯。Default reports 不能改。","C":"對。官方：default reports 不能修改；要自訂就建 custom report。","D":"錯。不是權限問題，是 default report 本身不可改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-default-reports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.2-e07","sec":"420.7.2","dom":"420.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are default (non-editable) reports in a JSM service project? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些是 JSM service project 的 default（不可編輯）報表？（選兩個）","zo":["Satisfaction","Created vs resolved","SLA met vs breached","Time to resolution","Requests deflected"],"fig":"","opts":["Satisfaction","Created vs resolved","SLA met vs breached","Time to resolution","Requests deflected"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Default report 之一：平均 CSAT。","B":"錯。這是可編輯的 custom report。","C":"錯。Custom report。","D":"錯。Custom report。","E":"對。Default report 之一：customer 看 KB 文章覺得有幫助的次數。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-default-reports/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-custom-reports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.2-e08","sec":"420.7.2","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leadership wants one chart comparing SLA breaches for VIP customers and non-VIP customers over time. What should the project admin build?","zh":"主管想在同一張圖比較 VIP 與非 VIP 客戶的 SLA 違約趨勢。Project admin 應建立什麼？","zo":["CSAT 問卷","Custom report，加兩個 SLA breached series，分別用 JQL 篩 VIP 與非 VIP","兩個分開的 project","依 SLA 排序的 queue"],"fig":"","opts":["A CSAT survey","A custom report with two SLA breached series, each filtered with JQL for VIP and non-VIP","Two separate projects","A queue sorted by SLA"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。CSAT 量滿意度，不是 SLA 違約。","B":"對。Custom report 可加多個 series，每個 series 用 JQL 篩選，畫在同一張圖上比較。","C":"錯。拆 project 不必要。","D":"錯。Queue 不是趨勢圖。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-is-a-report-series/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/create-a-new-custom-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.2-e09","sec":"420.7.2","dom":"420.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customers receive CSAT surveys even for requests closed as 'Won't do' with no resolution set. Why?","zh":"即使 request 以「Won't do」關閉、沒設 resolution，customer 仍收到 CSAT 問卷。為什麼？","zo":["Work item 進入 Done 類別的 status 就會寄 CSAT，即使沒有 resolution","每則留言都會寄 CSAT","SLA 違約了","問卷問題寫錯"],"fig":"","opts":["CSAT is sent when a work item moves to a Done status category, even without a resolution","CSAT is sent on every comment","The SLA was breached","The survey question is wrong"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：CSAT 在 work item 進入 Done 類別的 status 時觸發，即使 resolution 沒設。","B":"錯。不是每則留言都寄。","C":"錯。SLA 與 CSAT 觸發無關。","D":"錯。問題文字不影響觸發時機。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-customer-satisfaction-surveys-csats/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.7.2-e10","sec":"420.7.2","dom":"420.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The 'Requests deflected' report is low and many simple how-to questions become requests. Which changes are appropriate? (Choose two.)","zh":"「Requests deflected」報表偏低，許多簡單的操作問題都變成 request。哪些調整合適？（選兩個）","zo":["移除所有 portal groups","為常見問題撰寫或更新知識庫文章","在相關 request form 開啟 article suggestions","延長 SLA 目標時間","停用 CSAT"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove all portal groups","Write or update knowledge base articles for common questions","Enable article suggestions on the relevant request forms","Increase SLA goal times","Disable CSAT"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。會讓 customer 找不到 request type。","B":"對。Deflection 依賴 customer 能找到有用的文章。","C":"對。在提單時推薦文章能提高自助比例。","D":"錯。SLA 目標與自助率無關。","E":"錯。CSAT 與 deflection 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-are-default-reports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.1-e01","sec":"420.8.1","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Team leads want a Slack message 30 minutes before any request breaches its 'Time to resolution' SLA. What is the best approach?","zh":"Team lead 希望在任何 request 的「Time to resolution」SLA 違約前 30 分鐘收到 Slack 訊息。最好的做法？","zo":["Request created 的 customer notification","每日的 filter subscription","Automation rule：SLA threshold breached trigger 設為違約前 30 分鐘","依 SLA 排序的 queue"],"fig":"","opts":["A customer notification on Request created","A daily filter subscription","An automation rule with the SLA threshold breached trigger set to 30 minutes before breach","A queue sorted by SLA"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Customer notification 寄給 customer，而且是建立時。","B":"錯。每天一次太慢，不能在違約前 30 分鐘通知。","C":"對。SLA threshold breached trigger 可以設定違約前多久觸發，再 Send Slack message。","D":"錯。Queue 只是排序，不會主動通知。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.1-e02","sec":"420.8.1","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a 'Laptop repair' request moves to 'In repair', the laptop's Status attribute in Assets should change to 'In repair'. What should be used?","zh":"「Laptop repair」request 進入「In repair」時，Assets 裡該筆電的 Status attribute 要改成「In repair」。應該用什麼？","zo":["Queue 篩選","Customer notification","更新 Assets object Status attribute 的 automation rule","編輯 Assets schema 的 post function"],"fig":"","opts":["A queue filter","A customer notification","An automation rule that updates the Assets object's Status attribute","A post function that edits the Assets schema"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Queue 不會改資料。","B":"錯。通知不會改資料。","C":"對。考綱明列：用 automation 在 work item 到某 status 時更新 Asset 的 status attribute（Edit object／Assets 動作）。","D":"錯。Workflow post function 不是修改 Assets object 的標準方式。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.1-e03","sec":"420.8.1","dom":"420.8","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Only 'Laptop request' tickets should send customers pickup instructions when they reach 'Ready for pickup', including the office address. Why is automation better than the built-in customer notifications here? (Choose two.)","zh":"只有「Laptop request」在進入「Ready for pickup」時，要寄給 customer 含辦公室地址的取件說明。為什麼此處 automation 比內建 customer notifications 更適合？（選兩個）","zo":["Automation 不需要任何權限","Automation 能用 condition 限定特定 request type 與 status","內建 customer notification 規則以事件、全 project 為單位，不能只針對一個 request type 與 status","Automation 是寄信給 customer 的唯一方式","內建通知不能使用變數"],"fig":"","opts":["Automation doesn't need any permissions","Automation can limit the email to a specific request type and status with conditions","Built-in customer notification rules are project-wide and event-based, not specific to one request type and status","Automation is the only way to email customers at all","Built-in notifications can't use variables"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Automation 仍需要 actor 有相應權限。","B":"對。Automation 可以用 condition 限定 request type 與 status。","C":"對。內建 customer notification 是依事件、對整個 project 生效，無法只針對單一 request type 的特定 status。","D":"錯。內建通知也會寄給 customer。","E":"錯。內建通知可以插入 variables。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/what-notifications-do-my-customers-and-service-desk-team-receive/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.1-e04","sec":"420.8.1","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A one-time cleanup requires changing the priority of 400 old requests. What is most appropriate?","zh":"一次性的清理工作需要改 400 張舊 request 的 priority。最適合的做法？","zo":["Workflow post function","Customer notification","永遠執行的 scheduled automation rule","Bulk change"],"fig":"","opts":["A workflow post function","A customer notification","A scheduled automation rule that runs forever","A bulk change"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Post function 只在 transition 時執行。","B":"錯。通知不改資料。","C":"錯。一次性的工作不需要長期存在的 rule。","D":"對。一次性的大量修改用 bulk change。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.1-e05","sec":"420.8.1","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An automation rule now sends a custom 'Your request is in progress' email to customers. Customers complain about receiving two emails. What should be done?","zh":"Automation rule 現在會寄自訂的「您的 request 處理中」email 給 customer，customer 抱怨收到兩封。應該怎麼做？","zo":["關閉 CSAT","停用對應的內建 customer notification 規則","刪掉 automation rule","把 customer 從 project 移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Turn off CSAT","Disable the corresponding built-in customer notification rule","Delete the automation rule","Remove customers from the project"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。CSAT 與這封信無關。","B":"對。用 automation 取代內建通知時，要把對應的 customer notification 規則關掉，否則會重複。","C":"錯。Automation 就是要取代的版本。","D":"錯。不合理。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-service-management-cloud/docs/edit-the-content-of-your-customer-notifications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e06","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Requests in 'Waiting for customer' with no update for 3 days should be resolved automatically with a comment to the customer. Which rule configuration fits?","zh":"「Waiting for customer」狀態且 3 天沒更新的 request 要自動解決，並留言給 customer。哪個 rule 設定適合？","zo":["Scheduled trigger，JQL condition 篩 status 與 updated <= -3d，Transition to Resolved 並 Comment","Work item created trigger 加 Send email","SLA threshold breached trigger 加 Delete work item","Approval completed trigger 加 Transition"],"fig":"","opts":["Scheduled trigger, JQL condition for status and updated <= -3d, Transition to Resolved and Comment","Work item created trigger and Send email","SLA threshold breached trigger and Delete work item","Approval completed trigger and Transition"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。每天排程檢查符合 JQL 的 request，轉 Resolved 並留言給 customer，就是典型 auto-resolve。","B":"錯。建立時觸發無法判斷 3 天沒回。","C":"錯。刪除 work item 不是 auto-resolve。","D":"錯。與 approval 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e07","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which triggers are specific to Jira Service Management? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些 trigger 是 JSM 專屬的？（選兩個）","zo":["Work item transitioned","Scheduled","Sprint started","Approval required","SLA threshold breached"],"fig":"","opts":["Work item transitioned","Scheduled","Sprint started","Approval required","SLA threshold breached"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。一般 Jira trigger。","B":"錯。一般 trigger。","C":"錯。Jira Software trigger。","D":"對。JSM 專屬：需要核准時觸發。","E":"對。JSM 專屬：SLA 違約或即將違約時觸發。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e08","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin tries to build a project-level rule starting with the 'Object created' trigger for Assets, but can't. Why?","zh":"Project admin 想建一條以 Assets「Object created」trigger 開頭的 project rule，卻做不到。為什麼？","zo":["Trigger 前要先有 JQL condition","只有 agent 能用 Assets trigger","Object trigger 只能用在 global automation rule","Assets 需要 Premium 方案"],"fig":"","opts":["The trigger needs a JQL condition first","Only agents can use Assets triggers","Object triggers can only be used in global automation rules","Assets requires a Premium plan"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Trigger 不需要先有 condition。","B":"錯。與 agent 無關。","C":"對。官方：Object trigger 只能用在 global automation。","D":"錯。題目問的是不能在 project rule 使用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e09","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An automation rule uses 'Edit request type' to change a request from 'Get IT help' (IT help issue type) to 'Request new hardware' (Purchase issue type). The audit log shows an error. Why?","zh":"Automation rule 用「Edit request type」把 request 從「Get IT help」（IT help issue type）改成「Request new hardware」（Purchase issue type），audit log 出現錯誤。為什麼？","zo":["Edit request type 只能用在 team-managed project","Actor 是 Automation for Jira","Request type 建立後不能改","新的 request type 必須對應 work item 目前的 issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit request type only works in team-managed projects","The actor is the Automation for Jira user","Request types can't be changed after creation","The new request type must correspond to the work item's current issue type"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不是限 team-managed。","B":"錯。Actor 預設就是 Automation for Jira，不是錯誤原因。","C":"錯。可以改，只要 issue type 對得上。","D":"對。官方：選擇的 request type 必須對應該 work item 的 issue type，否則 audit log 會出錯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e10","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule needs the due date set to three business days from now. Which smart value fits?","zh":"Rule 要把 due date 設為從現在起三個工作天後。哪個 smart value 適合？","zo":["{{now.plusDays(3)}}","{{issue.created.plusBusinessDays(3).diff}}","{{#=}}now + 3{{/}}","{{now.plusBusinessDays(3)}}"],"fig":"","opts":["{{now.plusDays(3)}}","{{issue.created.plusBusinessDays(3).diff}}","{{#=}}now + 3{{/}}","{{now.plusBusinessDays(3)}}"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。plusDays 包含週末。","B":"錯。語法不完整，且以建立日而非現在。","C":"錯。數學運算 smart value 不能這樣處理日期。","D":"對。plusBusinessDays(3) 加三個工作天。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-smart-values-date-and-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e11","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants to quickly find all notification-related automation rules among dozens of rules. What should be used?","zh":"Admin 想在幾十條 rule 中快速找出所有與通知相關的 automation rule。應該用什麼？","zo":["Rule actor","Audit log","Labels","Rule scope"],"fig":"","opts":["Rule actor","Audit log","Labels","Rule scope"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Actor 是執行者。","B":"錯。Audit log 是執行紀錄。","C":"對。Labels 用來分類、篩選 rule。","D":"錯。Scope 決定 rule 在哪裡執行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/organize-your-rules-with-labels/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.2-e12","sec":"420.8.2","dom":"420.8","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions are specific to Jira Service Management automation? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些 action 是 JSM 專屬的？（選兩個）","zo":["Approve/decline request","Create work item with a request type","Transition work item","Send email","Log action"],"fig":"","opts":["Approve/decline request","Create work item with a request type","Transition work item","Send email","Log action"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。JSM 專屬：自動核准或拒絕。","B":"對。JSM 專屬：用 request type 建立 work item。","C":"錯。一般 Jira action。","D":"錯。一般 action。","E":"錯。一般 action（除錯用）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.3-e13","sec":"420.8.3","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule fires but the audit log shows 'No actions performed'. What does this most likely mean?","zh":"Rule 有觸發，但 audit log 顯示「No actions performed」。最可能的意思？","zo":["Rule 壞了，必須重建","Trigger 執行了，但 condition 不符，因此沒有執行 action","達到 service limit","Rule actor 被刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["The rule is broken and must be recreated","The trigger ran, but a condition did not match, so no action was taken","The service limit was reached","The rule actor was deleted"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。這是正常行為，不是故障。","B":"對。觸發了，但 condition 擋下，rule 依設計停止。","C":"錯。超過 service limit 會顯示 Throttled。","D":"錯。Actor 問題通常會是錯誤。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.3-e14","sec":"420.8.3","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule's email shows the wrong service tier, and the admin wants to see the actual value of {{issue.Affected services.tier}} during execution. What should they add?","zh":"Rule 寄出的 email 顯示錯誤的 service tier，admin 想看 {{issue.Affected services.tier}} 執行時的實際值。應該加什麼？","zo":["在 email 步驟前加 Log action","新增 label","第二個 trigger","Customer notification"],"fig":"","opts":["A Log action before the email step","A new label","A second trigger","A customer notification"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Log action 把值寫進 audit log，用來檢查 smart value。","B":"錯。Label 只是分類。","C":"錯。一條 rule 只能一個 trigger。","D":"錯。與除錯無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.3-e15","sec":"420.8.3","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The owner of 40 automation rules is leaving the company. The team wants error notifications to go to a new owner. What should a Jira admin do?","zh":"40 條 automation rule 的 owner 要離職，團隊希望錯誤通知改寄給新 owner。Jira admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["先刪除舊使用者的帳號","在 global automation 用 Transfer user 把舊使用者換成新使用者","停用 40 條 rule","修改每條 rule 的 label"],"fig":"","opts":["Delete the old user's account first","Use Transfer user in global automation to replace the old user with the new one","Disable all 40 rules","Change each rule's label"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。先刪帳號會讓 rule 出錯，且沒有解決 owner。","B":"對。Transfer user 一次把所有 rule 的 owner、actor 與 user picker 裡的舊使用者換成新使用者。","C":"錯。停用會讓自動化停止。","D":"錯。Label 不影響通知。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/transfer-jira-automation-rules-from-one-user-to-another/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.3-e16","sec":"420.8.3","dom":"420.8","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A single global rule runs across 12 service projects. An admin edits its condition. What is the implication?","zh":"一條 global rule 在 12 個 service project 執行。Admin 修改了它的 condition。影響是？","zo":["Scope 內的 12 個 project 都會受影響","每個 project 保留舊版本","Global rule 不能編輯","只影響做修改的那個 project"],"fig":"","opts":["The change affects all 12 projects in scope","Each project keeps the old version","Global rules can't be edited","Only the project where the edit was made is affected"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Scope 涵蓋的所有 project 都會套用修改，好處是只維護一份，風險是影響範圍大。","B":"錯。沒有版本分開。","C":"錯。Jira admin 可以編輯。","D":"錯。多 project rule 只有一份設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"420.8.3-e17","sec":"420.8.3","dom":"420.8","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Performance insights show many executions marked 'Throttled'. What does this indicate, and what helps? (Choose two.)","zh":"Performance insights 顯示許多執行被標為「Throttled」。這代表什麼？怎麼改善？（選兩個）","zo":["Rule 超過 automation service limit","縮小 trigger 與 JQL 範圍，讓 rule 少執行","Rule 沒有 condition","Audit log 過期","必須更換 rule owner"],"fig":"","opts":["The rules are breaching automation service limits","Narrow triggers and JQL so the rules run less often","The rules have no conditions","The audit log has expired","The rule owner must be changed"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Throttled 代表超過 service limit。","B":"對。用更精準的 trigger、JQL、縮小 scope、減少 branch 可以降低執行量。","C":"錯。Throttled 與有沒有 condition 無直接關係。","D":"錯。Audit log 保存期與 throttling 無關。","E":"錯。Owner 不影響 service limit。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/view-performance-insights-for-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0}];